<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">RUK- Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibhiri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">Ruka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Vhangeri Ridonyohwa naRuka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ruk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Vhangeri Ridonyohwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">naRUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">KUWIDZIRA</para>
  <para style="ip">Vhangeri ridonyohwa naRuka ndimwe romabhuku manai yoChitenderano Chitsva yanotsanangura upenyu hwaJesu Khirisitu. Pamabhuku manai yakareya rimwe norimwe rinoitiwa Vhangeri, zvinoreva kuti “Nhau Dzidonaka.” Mabhuku yoya yari manai daipa yadonyohwa naMateo, Mariko, Ruka naJohwani, mumasure moipfa yaJesu. Munyori anoitiwa Ruka haanai kundonyora nyaya youpenyu hwaJesu chete, asi adonyorawo bhuku rinoitiwa Mabasa yoNhumwa. Mubhuku raMabasa Ruka adonyora zvinhu zvidoitiwa novadzidzi mumasure mokupfa nokumuka kwaJesu. Hapanai anoziva nguwa chaiyo padonyohwa Vhangeri raRuka kana nzvimbo kwaridonyorehwa. Asi vazinji vanodzidza zvoBhaibhiri vanoti rinenge ridonyohwa makore makumi manomwe (70) mumasure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Munyori wakareyu, anoitiwa Ruka, waiva murapi anoshandisa mishonga. Manyorero yache nomashandisiro yache mazvi zvinoisa pachenu kuti wanga ari munhu adodzidza. Ruka adoda kunyora tsananguro idorungama pamusoro poupenyu hwaJesu, achinatsa kutsanangura maitikiro yozvidoitika, kuti vanoverenga zvaadonyora vabatsirike (Ruka 1:1-3). Ruka wanga asiri muJudha (Vakorose 4:10-14), saka adonyora nomanyorero yanonzvitsitsiwa novasiri maJudha. Zvakarezvi zvinooneka pakutsanangura kwache zvotsika dzochiJudha (Ruka 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Vhangeri yaRuka idoita fanike yaMateo noyaMariko nokuti mabhuku yakareya yanotsanangura zvibodzibodzizvo nomutoo udofanana. Pakati payene yese yari matatu, Ruka ndiye wega anotsanangura zvidokwana pamusoro pokuzvahwa kwaJohwani Muombeki. Ruka anotsindikira pamusoro pokuregerehwa (Ruka 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) futi anonyaira zvidonyanya pamusoro pokunamata (chitsauko 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 23:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Muchitsauko chomuna (Ruka 1:1-4), Ruka anowidzira vhangeri rache achitsanangura chikonzero chaadorinyorera.</para>
  <para style="io1">Adodzotsanangura zvokuzvahwa kwaJesu nonzira yaadozvigadzirira nayo ushumiri (Ruka 1:5—4:13).</para>
  <para style="io1">Chikamu chikuru choVhangeri raRuka chidonyohwa zvobasa ridoitiwa naJesu. Muchikamu chakarechi Ruka adonyanya kunyora pamusoro pozvishamiso zvidoitiwa naJesu kusanganisira kudzidzisa kwaadoita.</para>
  <para style="io1">Chokupedzisira, muzvitsauko zvitatu zvokumhera (22-24) Ruka adotsanangura mapfiro yaJesu, mavikhihwo nomamukiro yaadodzoita kubva kuvadopfa.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Kudaiku panovazinji vadozvipira kuisa pabodzi rondedzero yozvinhu zvidozazisiwa pakati pedu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Ndinokunyorerai semapasihwo yatidozviitiwa naivo vanga vari pfakazi dzidozviona futi vari vashumairi voshoko. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Saka sezvandidozviteedza zvese ndiri papfupi nazvo kwonguwa irefu, zvidondinakirawo kukunyorerai nhoroondo yokuteedzana kwazvene, iyemi vanoremekedzewa zvidonyanya vaTiofirasi. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Ndinozviitira kuti muzive chokwadi pamusoro pozvinhu zvamudonyepewa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzivisiwa Kwokuzvahwa KwaJohwani Muombeki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Mumazuva yaHerudhe, mambo woJudhiya, kwaiva nomuphirisita waiitiwa Zakariya, wogovero raAbhiya, waiva nomukadzi wanga ari wokuvanasikana vaAroni, zita rache richiitiwa Erizabheti. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Vese murume nomukadzi, vanga vadorurama pamberi paMwari, vachifamba mumitemo yese nomumirau yaIshe pasinai chaishoreka. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Asi vanga vasinai mwana, ndava Erizabheti waiva ngomwa, futi vese vanga vakaramba.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Zvino padosvika zoro raZakariya, adoshumira semupirisita pamberi paMwari. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Zvidoitika maererano notsika youphirisita, kuti adobatiwa nohakata kuti apinde mukherekhe yaIshe kuti apise zvinonushira, <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />ipopo panguwa yozvinonushira mhomho yese yanga ichinamata iri panze. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Zvino ngirozi yaIshe idoonewa naZakariya, idomira kuruji roatari yozvinonushira. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakariya paadoona ngirozi adonetseka nazvo, ndokubva wabatiwa nokucha. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Asi ngirozi idoti kwaari, “Reka kucha, Zakariya, ndava munamato wako wanzvika, futi mukadzi wako Erizabheti achakuberekera mwana mukomana, iwepa womutenza zita rokuti Johwani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Futi uchava nomufaro nokukondwa, novazinji vachafara pakuzvahwa kwache. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Nokuti achava mukuru pamberi paIshe, achamwaba waini kana zvinokora, futi achazadziwa naMweya Mutsvene, kubva mudumbu ramaache, <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />futi achadzotsa vanakomana vazinji vovaIzirairi kuna Ishe Mwari wavo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Achaenda pamberi paIshe mumweya nomusimba raEriya, kuti adzotse mwoyo yanababa kuvana, novasingateereri kuuchenjeri hwovadorurama, kuva anoitira Ishe vanhu vadogadzirira.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zvino Zakariya adoti kungirozi, “Ndingazvizive tini zvakarezvi? Ndava ndakaramba, futi mukadzi wangu wachembera.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Ipopo ngirozi idomupindura ichiti, “Ndini Gabhurieri, anomira pamberi paMwari, ndidotumiwa konyaira kwauri, nokukuvikhira nyaya yakarei idonaka. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Manje chionaka, uchanyarara futi wotadza kunyaira kusvikira pazuva razvichaitika zvakarezvi, ndava haunai kutenda mashoko yangu, yachazazisiwa nonguwa yayene.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ipopo vanhu vanga vadomirira Zakariya, vadoshamisika nokuchehwa kwache mukherekhe. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Paadodzobirika, adokonaba kunyaira kwavari, ivo vadobva vaziva kuti wanga waona chiratidzo mukherekhe, adoita zvokuninira kwavari ndokuramba ari chimumumu.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Padopera nguwa yache yokushumaira, adoenda kumba kwache. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Musure momazuva yakareyo mukadzi wache Erizabheti adoita mimba, ndokuzvihwanza kwomwedzi mishano, achiti, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Ndizvo zvidoitiwa naIshe kwandiri pamazuva yaadondinangara, kuti abiritse kushoreka kwangu pakati povanhu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzvahwa KwaJesu Kunotauhwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Mumwedzi wochitanhatu ngirozi Gabhurieri idotumiwa naMwari kuenda kuguta roGaririya rinoitiwa Nazareta. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Idoenda kumhandara yanga idobvunzihwa nomurume waiitiwa Josefa, woimba yaDhavhiti. Zita romhandara yacho raiitiwa Mariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Ngirozi idouya kwaari ndokuti, “Mufaro kwauri, iwe waitihwa mutsa, Ishe anewe!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Asi Mariya adonetseka maninge nokunyaira kwakareko, futi adofunga mupfungwa dzache kuti yangave mamoresero hwai yadodaro. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ngirozi idoti kwaari, “Reka kucha, Mariya, ndava waitihwa mutsa naMwari. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Saka chiona kuti, uchava nopamuviri wopona mwana mukomana, wauchatenza zita rokuti Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Achava mukuru, futi achadaidziwa kuti Mwanakomana woWokumusorosoro, futi Ishe Mwari vachamupasa mupando wokutonga wababa vache Dhavhiti, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />futi achava Mambo muimba yaJakobho nokusingapere, noumambo hwache hunopfurukaba.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Asi Mariya adoti kungirozi, “Anga zvakarezvi zvinoitika tini, sezvo inipano ndisinai murume?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Ngirozi idoti kwaari, “Mweya Mutsvene achauya pauri, nomasimba yoWokumusorosoro yachakufukidza, saka mwana achazvahwa achaitiwa mutsvene, Mwanakomana waMwari. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Chionaka, hama yako Erizabheti mukuchembera kwache watovawo nomimba yomwana mukomana, mwedzi uno watova wochitanhatu womunhu wakareyo waiitiwa ngomwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Nokuti naMwari hapanai chisingagoneke.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mariya adoti, “Onai, ndiri murandakadzi waIshe, mbazviitike kwandiri zvarehwa noshoko renyu.” Ngirozi idobva yabirika paari.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mariya Anobvakachira Erizabheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mumazuva yakareyo Mariya adosumuka nokamangu kuenda kunyika yomakomo, kuguta roJudhiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Adopinda mumba maZakariya ndokumoresa Erizabheti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Zvino Erizabheti paadondonzva izvi rokumoresa kwaMariya, mwana adochiruka mudumbu rache. Erizabheti adozaziwa naMweya Mutsvene, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />futi adobva wakanuka ndokunyaira noizvi rinoruzha achiti, “Udoropafadziwa iwewe pakati paanhikadzi, futi budzi rochibereko chako ridoropafadziwa! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Asi ndava yei ndaitihwa zvakarezvi, zvokuti amai vaIshe wangu vanouya kwandiri? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Nokuti izvi rokundimoresa kwako parandosvika munzeve dzangu, mwana ari mudumbu mangu wachiruka nomufaro. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Adoropafadziwa iye adotenda nokuti kuchava nokuzazisiwa kwozvidonyaihwa naIshe kwaari .”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chimbo chaMariya Chokurumbidza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Futi Mariya adoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Mwoyo wangu unokudza Ishe,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />mweya wangu unofarira Mwari Muponisi wangu,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Ndava adorangarira kuzvidzika kwomurandasikana wache.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Nokuti kubva zvino mazera yese yovanhu yachanditi ndidoropafadziwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />nokuti iye anomasimba adondiitira zvinhu zvikuru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Zita rache ritsvene,<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />tsitsi dzache dziri pamusoro paivo vanomucha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">kubva kumarudzi kusvika kumarudzi.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Wanangidza simba noruoko rache,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">wapamwadza vanozvitutumadza pamafungiro yomwoyo yavo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Wagadzika pasi vanomasimba achivabiritsa pamipando yavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">achikwidziridza vadozvidzika.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Wagutisa nozvinhu zvidonaka vanonzara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">vapfumi wavaendesa vari maoko vhuzuvhuzu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Wabatsira muranda wache Izirairi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">mukuyeuka tsitsi dzache kwaari.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Sekunyaira kwaadoita kumadzibaba yedu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">kuna Abhurahamu nokuvana vache nokusingapere.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mariya adogara naErizabheti mwedzi inosvika mitatu, ndokuzodzoka kumba kwache.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzvahwa KwaJohwani Muombeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Zvino nguwa idosvika yokuti Erizabheti apone, adopona mwana mukomana. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Zvino vavakhidzani vache nohama dzache pavadonzva kuti Ishe wamunzvira tsitsi maninge, vadobva vafara naye.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Vadouya nozuva rochisere kudzochecheudza mwana, pakarepo vadoda kumutenza zita rababa vache rokuti Zakariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Asi amai vache vadoti, “Neye, achatenzewa zita rokuti Johwani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Vadoti kwaari, “Pahama dzenyu hapanai anodaidziwa nozita rakareri.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Vadoninira nomanja kuna baba vomwana, vachibvunza zita raidiwa nababa kuti mwana atenzewe.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakariya adokumbira hwendefa rokunyorera, ndokunyora kuti “Zita romwana ndiJohwani.” Vese vadoshamisika nazvo. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Pasinai nonhambwe yese muromo waZakariya udovhurika, chirimi chache ndokupfuduka, adobva wathanga kutaura achikudza Mwari. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Kucha kudouya kuvavakhidzani vavo vese, zvinhu zvakarezvi zvese zvidotauhwa munyika yese yomakomo yoJudhiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Vese vadozvinzva vadozviisa muhana dzavo, vachiti, “Mwana iyeyu achava yani?” Ndava janja raIshe ranga rinaye.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuporofita kwaZakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zvino Zakariya baba vache vadozadziwa naMweya Mutsvene, ndokuporofita vachiti,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Mbaakudziwe Ishe Mwari waIzirairi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">ndava wabvakachira nokununura vanhu vache.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Futi watisimudzira simba roruponiso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">muimba yomuranda wache Dhavhiti.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Sekunyaira kwaadoita nomuromo wovaporofiti vache vatsvene kubva karekare,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />kuti atiponese kubva kumhandu dzedu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">nokubva kuno vese vanotizonda,<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />kuti aite mutsa udovimbisiwa madzibaba yedu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">nokuyeuka chibvumirano chache chitsvene.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Mhiko yaadopikira kuna baba vedu Abhurahamu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />kutipasa kuti isisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">tikasununguhwa kubva paruoko rovavengi vedu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">timushumire tisingache,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />muutsvene nomukururama pamberi pache</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">mazuva yese yokurarama kwedu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Iwe, mwana, uchadaidziwa kuti muporofiti woWokumusorosoro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">ndava uchaenda pamberi paIshe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">kuti umunhadzirire nzira dzache,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />kuti upase ruzivo roruponiso kuvanhu vache</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">kuburikidza nokuregerehwa kwozvitadzo zvavo,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />nondava yokupfava kwotsitsi dzaMwari wedu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">patichabudihwa nozuva kubva kumusoro<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />kupasa chiedza kuno avo vadogara murima nomumumvuri woipfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">nokutungamira tsoka dzedu munzira yorugare.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Futi mwana adokura ndokuva nosimba pamweya, adogara musango kusvikira pazuva raadodzozviisa pachenu kuvaIzirairi.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuzvahwa KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mateo 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Pamazuva yakareyo chirevo chidobva kuna Ogasito Khesari kuti nyika yese inyohwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Kwakareku kwanga kuri kunyohwa kwokuthanga kudoitiwa Sairiniyasi ari mutongi woSiriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Munhu wese adoenda konyohwa, umwe noumwe kuguta rache.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />NaJosefawo adobva kuGaririya, muguta roNazareta, ndokuenda kuJudhiya, muguta raDhavhiti rinoitiwa Bheterehema, nokuti wanga ari wodzinza nowoimba yaDhavhiti. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Adoenda konyohwa pabodzi naMariya waadokonza, wanga wava nomimba, <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />futi pavanga vari kwakareko, nguwa yokupona kwaMariya idosvika. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Adopona mwana wache mukomana wodangwe ndokumuputiridza nomapiza, nokumuenzeresa muchijiro chozvipfuwo, ndava kwanga kusinai nzvimbo mudzimba dzovarendo.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anyakabusa noNgirozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Mudunhu rakarero manga munananyakabusa, vaichengeta mahwai yavo usiku. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Ngirozi yaIshe idozvionesa kwavari, kubhwinya kwaIshe ndokuvapenyera kumativi yese, ivo ndokubatiwa nokucha. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ipopo ngirozi idoti kwavari, “Rekai kucha, nokuti, ndakuunzirai nyaya idonaka yomufaro mukuru uchava wovanhu vese. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Ndava nasi muguta raDhavhiti, mazvarihwa Muponisi, ndiye Khirisitu Ishe. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Futi ichi ndicho chichava chiratidzo kwamuri, muchawana mwana adoputiridziwa nomapiza adoenzeresewa muchijiro chozvipfuwo.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Kabodzi nokabodzi kudovapo pabodzi nongirozi yakareyo hondo yokudenga ikurufutiyo, yanga ichirumbidza Mwari ichiti,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Kubhwinya mbakuve kuna Mwari Wokumusorosoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">nopanyika mbapave norugare pakati povanhu vanomufadza!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ngirozi padzidobirika pavari dzichienda kudenga, anyakabusa vadotaurirana vachiti, “Mbatiendei kuBheterehema toona chinhu chakarechi chaitika, chataudziwa naIshe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Saka vadoenda nokamangu, ndokuwana Mariya naJosefa, nomwana adoenzeresewa muchijiro chozvipfuwo. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Pavadomuona vadozivisa zvanga zvatauhwa kwavari pamusoro pomwana wakareyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Vanhu vese vadozvinzva vadoshamisiwa nozvavadonyepewa nananyakabusa. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Asi Mariya adochengeta zvinhu zvakarezvo zvese, achizvifungitsitsa mumwoyo mache. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Anyakabusa vadodzokera, vachikudza nokurumbidza Mwari pamusoro pozvese zvavadonzva nozvavadoona, semaudzihwo yavanga vaitiwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anopasiwa Zita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Mumasure momazuva masere, mwana paanga wachecheudziwa, adotenzewa zita rokuti Jesu, iro raadopasiwa nongirozi asati wava mudumbu.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu anoKumikidziwa muImba yaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Padokwana nguwa yokuzvinatsa kwavo maererano nomutemo waMozisi, vadouya naye kuJerusarema kuti vamupereke kuna Ishe <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Zvakarezvi zvidoitika kuti mutemo waIshe uzazisiwe unoti, “Murume wese anozurura chibereko achanzi mutsvene kuna Ishe.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Vadodzoenda kopira chipiriso zvichienderana nozvinotauhwa nomutemo waIshe, zvinoti, “tuvana tuiri tonjiva, kana marunga mairi yohangaiva.”<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Zvino muJerusarema maiva nomunhu waiitiwa Simiyoni, murume wakareyu wanga adorurama futi adozvipira, waitarisira kunyaradziwa kwovaIzirairi, Mweya Mutsvene wanga ari paari. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Wanga adoisihwa pachenu naMweya Mutsvene kuti waidzoonaba ipfa asati waona Khirisitu waIshe. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Paadofemehwa naMweya adouya muimba yaMwari, zvino vabereki pavadouya nomwana Jesu, kudzomuitira zviri maererano notsika yomutemo, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simiyoni adotora mwana mumaoko mache achibva warumbidza Mwari achiti,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Ishe, zvino chiregai zvenyu muranda wenyu aende norugare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">maererano noshoko renyu,<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />ndava meso yangu yaona ruponiso renyu<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />ramudogadzirira pamberi povanhu vese,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />chiedza chokuzarurihwa kumarudzi yasiri maJudha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">nokubhwinya kuvanhu venyu vaIzirairi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Baba vache namai vache vadoshamisiwa nozvidonyaihwa pamusoro pache. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Zvino Simiyoni adovaropafadza achibva wati kuna Mariya amai vache, “Ona, Mwana wakareyu adomisihwa kuwa nokusumuka kwovazinji muIzirairi, nochiratidzo chinonyaihwa zvokupikisa <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />futi bakatwa richakubaya nokutobirikira pamweya pako, kuti pfungwa dzomuhana dzovazinji dziisiwe pachenu.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Paiva nomuporofitikadzi, Ana, mwanasikana waFanueri, wodzinza raAsha, wanga atochemberetsa, wanga wandogara nomurume wache makore manomwe kubva paumhandara hwache, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />wanga ari mujiche kusvikira wava nomakore makumi masere nomanai. Waibirikaba muimba yaMwari, wainamata nokutsanya achinyengetera usiku nomasikati. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Paadouya nguwa yakareyo, adopasa kutenda kuna Mwari, achibva wanyaira pamusoro pache kuno vese vanga vadotarisira kudzikinuhwa kwoJerusarema.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanodzokera kuNazareta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Pavadoita zvese zviri maererano nomutemo waIshe, vadodzokera kuGaririya, kuguta ravo, Nazareta. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana adokura ndokuva nosimba, adozara nouchenjeri, nonyasha dzaMwari dzaiva paari.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu muImba yaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Zvino vabereki vache vaienda kuJerusarema makore yese kumabiko yoPhasika. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Jesu paanga wava nomakore gumi nomairi, vadoenda kumutambo zvaiva maererano notsika. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Padodzopera mutambo, vabereki vache vaakudzokera kumba, mwanakomana Jesu adosara kuJerusarema, asi vabereki vache vanga vasingazvizive, <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />vaifunga kuti wanga ari pabodzi naabiyavo, ndokufamba kwozuva rese, asi vadothanga kumutsvaga pakati pohama dzavo noshamwari dzavo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Zvino pavadomusaya, vadodzoka kuJerusarema komutsvaga. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Kwapera mazuva matatu vadodzomuwana ari muchivanze choimba yaMwari, wanga adogarikika pakati povadzidzisi, achivatetekera nokuvabvunza mibvunzo. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Vese vadomunzva vadoshamisika nomunzvitsitsiro wache nomhinduro dzache. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Vabereki vache pavadomuona vadoshamisika, amaache vadobva vati kwaari, “Nai mwana, watiitirei daipa? Ona, baba vako nainipano tanga tichishupika kukutsvaga.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Ko manga muchinditsvagirei? Hamuzive nai kuti ndinofanira kuva mumba maBaba vangu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Asi havanai kunzvitsitsa zvaanga achinyaira kwavari.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Zvino adoenda navo ndokusvika kuNazareta, futi waivateerera, asi amai vache vadochengeta zvinhu zvakarezvi zvese mumwoyo mavo. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Futi Jesu adoingidzika pauchenjeri nopamumhu, nopakudikana naMwari novanhu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Kuparidza KwaJohwani Muombeki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mariko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Johwani 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mugore rogumi nomashano rokutonga kwaTaibheriyasi Khesari, Pondiyasi Pirato ari mutongi woJudhiya, naHerudhe ari mutongi woGaririya, nomunin'ina wache Firipi ari mutongi womatunhu yoItariya noTirakonitisi, naRisaniyasi ari mutongi woAbhireni, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />panguwa yokuva muphirisita mukuru kwaAnasi naKhefasi, shoko raMwari ridouya kuna Johwani mwanakomana waZakariya ari musango. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Adoenda mudunhu rese ridopoteredza Jorodhani, achiparidza kuti vanhu vapinduke, vaombekewe kuti varegerehwe zvitadzo zvavo. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Semanyorehwo yazvidoitiwa mubhuku romashoko yomuporofiti Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Izvi roanokuwa musango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘nhadzirai mugwagwa waIshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">yororai nzira dzache!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Mipata yese ichafuchihwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">makomo notutunhu zvichaderedzewa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">nomagonyo yachayorohwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">nonzira dzinomaphubu dzichaenzanisiwa,<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Futi vanhu vese vachaona ruponiso raMwari.’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Naizvozvo adoti kumhomho idouya kwaari kudzoombekewa naye, “Imipa muri vana vonyoka! Mbani adokuchenjedzai kuti mutize ukari hunouya? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Berekai zvibereko zvinoenderana nokupinduka, futi rekai kuthanga kuzviti, ‘Tina Abhurahamu vanova baba vedu,’ ndava ndinokunyepai, Mwari anogona kumutsira vana Abhurahamu kubva pamabhwe aya. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Kudaiku demo ratoisiwa pamidzi yomiti, saka muti wese usingabereke zvibereko zvidonaka unogwatiwa uchikhandiwa mumoto.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Vanhu vadobva vamubvunza vachiti, “Manje toita tini?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Zvino adovapindura, “Uyo anohembe dziiri mbaakoverane noasina, noanozvokuja mbaaitewo zvibodzi bodzizvo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Vateresi vadouyawo kudzoombekewa vadoti kwaari, “Mudzidzisi, ko isisu tiitei?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Regai kutora zvidopindiridza zvamudotemehwa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Mauto yadomubvunzawo yachiti, “Ko isisuwo toita sei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Iye adoti kwavari, “Rekai kutorera vanhu nosimba kana nokunenedzera mhosva dzomabhwodo, gutsikanai nomihoro yenyu.” <verse eid="LUK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Vanhu pavaigurupira, vese vachifungira mumwoyo kuti pamwe Johwani wakareyu ndiye Khirisitu. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Johwani adovapindura vese, “Inipano ndinokuombekai nomvura, asi anomasimba kukunda inini ari kuuya, murau woshangu dzache ndinokodzeraba kusugudura, achakuombekai naMweya Mutsvene nomoto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Chisero chache anacho mumanja, kuti achenese udzire, nokuunganidzira gorosi muchitura, asi hundi achaipisa nomoto usingadzimwe.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Nokukurudzira kuzinji, adoparidza nyaya idonaka kuvanhu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Asi Herudhe mudzviti, waanga adzuma nondava yaHerodhiyasi, mukadzi womunin'ina wache, nokumwe kunyangadza kwese kwanga kwaitiwa naHerudhe, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />adoingidzira zvakarezvi zvese nokudzoisa Johwani mutorongo kwaadoita.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoombekewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mateo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mariko 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Zvino vanhu vese pavadoombekewa, naJesu waombekewawo ari pakunamata, denga ridozururiwa, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Mweya Mutsvene adoburuka achivhoda paari, adoita kunge njiva, futi izvi ridouya kubva kudenga richiti, “Iwepa ndiwe Mwanakomana wangu wandinoditsa, naiwepa ndinofadziwa maninge.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madziteteguru yaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mateo 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Jesu paadothanga ushumiri hwache, wanga wava nomakore yanenge makumi matatu, pakufungidzihwa ari mwanakomana waJosefa, mwanakomana waHeri, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />mwanakomana waMatati, mwanakomana waRevhi, mwanakomana waMeriki, mwanakomana waJanai, mwanakomana waJosefa, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />mwanakomana waMatatiyasi, mwanakomana waAmosi, mwanakomana waNahamu, mwanakomana waEsiri, mwanakomana waNagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />mwanakomana waMaata, mwanakomana waMatatiasi, mwanakomana waSemeini, mwanakomana waJoseki, mwanakomana waJodha, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />mwanakomana waJowanani, mwanakomana waRisa, mwanakomana waZerubhabheri, mwanakomana waSheritieri, mwanakomana waNeri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />mwanakomana waMeriki, mwanakomana waAdhi, mwanakomana waKosamu, mwanakomana waErimadhami, mwanakomana waEri, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />mwanakomana waJoshuwa, mwanakomana waEriezari mwanakomana waJorimi, mwanakomana waMatati, mwanakomana waRevhi <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />mwanakomana waSimiyoni, mwanakomana waJudha, mwanakomana waJosefa, mwanakomana waJonami, mwanakomana waEriyakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />mwanakomana waMeriya, mwanakomana waMena, mwanakomana waMatata, mwanakomana waNatani, mwanakomana waDhavhiti, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />mwanakomana waJese, mwanakomana waObhedhi, mwanakomana waBhowazi, mwanakomana waSara, mwanakomana waNashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />mwanakomana waAminadhabhi, mwanakomana waAdhimini, mwanakomana waAmi, mwanakomana waHezironi, mwanakomana waPherezi, mwanakomana waJudha, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />mwanakomana waJakobho, mwanakomana waIsaki, mwanakomana waAbhurahamu, mwanakomana waThera, mwanakomana waNaho, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />mwanakomana waSeragi, mwanakomana waReu, mwanakomana waPeregi, mwanakomana waEbha, mwanakomana waShera, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />mwanakomana waKeinani, mwanakomana waAfakisadhi, mwanakomana waShemi, mwanakomana waNowa, mwanakomana waRameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />mwanakomana waMatusera, mwanakomana waInoki, mwanakomana waJeredhi, mwanakomana waMaharareri, mwanakomana waKenani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />mwanakomana waInosi, mwanakomana waSeti, mwanakomana waAdhamu, mwanakomana waMwari.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kuedzewa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mateo 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mariko 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Zvino Jesu paanga adozara naMweya Mutsvene, adodzoka kubva kuJorodhani, futi adotungamihwa naMweya <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />kwomazuva makumi manai ari musango, achiedzewa najabhurosi. Hapanai chaadoja mumazuva yakareyo, payadodzopera, wanga waanonzara.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Jabhurosi adoti kwaari, “Kana uri Mwanakomana waMwari, raira ibhwe iri riite zingwa.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Asi Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Kudonyohwa kuti, ‘Munhu anoraramaba nozingwa basi.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Zvino jabhurosi adotora Jesu ndokuenda naye padokwirira nonguwa ipfupipfupiyo adomunangidza umambo hwese hwopasi, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />adoti kwaari, “Ndinokupasa ukuru hwesehwu nokubhwinya kwahwene, ndava ndidohupasiwa, uye ndinohupasawo wandinoda. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Kana ukandinamata, zvese zvingatova zvako.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Zvino Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Kudonyohwa kuti, ‘Unofanira kunamata Ishe Mwari wako basi iye chete ndiye waunofanira kushumira.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Ipopo adoenda naye kuJerusarema, ndokumugadzika pakatorotoro koimba yaMwari, ndokuti kwaari, “Kana uri Mwanakomana waMwari, zvikhandire pasi kubva pakarepano. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Ndava kudonyohwa kuti, ‘Acharaira ngirozi dzache pamusoro pako, kuti dzikuchengete.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Futi dzichakukacha, kuti gumbo rako rireke kurovera padombo.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Zvino Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Zvidotauhwa kuti, ‘Rega kuedza Ishe Mwari wako.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Zvino jabhurosi paadopedza kumuyedza nokuedza kwese, adobirika paari kusvikira pava noumwe mukana.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anothanga Basa Rache muGaririya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mateo 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mariko 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Zvino Jesu adodzokera kuGaririya ari musimba raMweya, nyaya pamusoro pache idosvika kunzvimbo dzese dzidopoteredza. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Adodzidzisa mumasinagoge yavo nokurumbidziwa novese.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anorambiwa muNazareta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mariko 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Zvino adosvika kuNazareta, kwaadokurira, setsika yache adopinda musinagoge nomusi woSabata. Adosumuka kuti averenge, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />adotambidziwa bhuku romuporofiti Isaya. Adophedenura bhuku ndokuwana padonyorewa,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Mweya waShe ari pandiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">nokuti adondizodza kuti ndiparidze nyaya idonaka kuvarombo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Adondituma kudzoparidza rusununguko kunhapwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">nokudzotsera meso kumarombe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">nokusunungura vadodzvinyirihwa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />kuti ndiparidze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">gore raShe rinotambirika.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ipopo adovhara bhuku, ndokuridzotsera kumubati, achibva wagarikika, meso yovese vanga vari musinagoge yadomudzvokora. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Iye adothanga kuti kwavari, “Nasi gwaro iri razazisiwa munzeve dzenyu.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Zvino vese vadonyaira zvidonaka pamusoro pache vachishamisika nomashoko yotsitsi yadobirika mumuromo mache. Vadobva vati, “Anga wakareyu mwanakomanaba waJosefa nai?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Pasina kupokana, muchanyaira tsumo kwandiri yokuti, ‘Murapi, zvirape, zvatidonzva kuti udoita kuKaperenaume, zviitewo muno mumusha mako.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ndokubva wati kwavari, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, hapanai muporofiti anotambirika munyika yache. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Asi ndinokuudzai chokwadi, paiva novajiche vazinji muIzirairi pamazuva yaEriya, padozarihwa denga kwomakore matatu nomwedzi mitanhatu, kudouya nzara ikuru munyika yese, <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Eriya adotumiwaba kuno umwe wavo, asi kumujiche kuZarefati basi, munyika yoSidhoni, kumukadzi wanga ari mujiche. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Futi muIzirairi manga muno vomapere vadowanda panguwa yomuporofiti Erisha, asi hapanai kana mubodzi adoporesewa kunze kwaNaamani muSiriya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Pavadonzva zvakarezvo, vese vanga vari musinagoge vadozara noukari. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Vadosumuka vachimubiritsa muguta, vadoenda naye kumapiripiri yopakatunhu panova padovakhihwa guta ravo, kuti vamugwididzire awe nomusoro. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Asi iye adobirika nopakati pavo ndokuenda zvache.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murume anoMweya Udoipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mariko 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Zvino adoenda kuKaperenaume, guta roGaririya, wanga achivadzidzisa nomusi woSabata. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Futi vadoshamisika nokudzidzisa kwache, nokuti shoko rache ranga rino chikuriri. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Musinagogemo manga muno murume wanga ano mweya riri shave ridoipa, adokuwa zvinoruzha achiti, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Aa! Munei nesu Jesu woNazareta? Mauya kudzotiparadza chere? Ndinokuzivai, kuti muri Mutsvene waMwari!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Asi Jesu adomudzuma achiti, “Nyarara ubirike maari!” Zvino shave paridomuwisira pasi pakati povanhu, ridobirika risinai kumukuwadza.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Vese vadoshamisiwa nazvo ndokutaurirana vachiti, “Shoko hwai rakareri? Ndava nosimba rochikuriri anodzuma mweya idoipa, ichibva yabirika!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Nhau pamusoro pache dzidosvika kumatunhu yese yadopoteredza.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Vanhu Vazinji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mariko 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Zvino adosumuka ndokubirika musinagoge achipinda mumba maSimoni. Manje amezvara vaSimoni vanga vachihwara nomuviri zvidonyanya, vadonyepa Jesu pamusoro pokuhwara kwakareko. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Jesu adomira pamberi paamezvara vaSimoni Pita ndokudzuma denda. Vadobva vapora kabodzi nokabodzi padenda rakarero, ivo ndokusumuka nokamangu vachitenairira vanhu.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Zvino zuva paranga raakunyura ratoti piriviri vese vanga vano vahwere vomatenda yadosiyanasiyana vadouya novahwerevo kuna Jesu, iye adoisa maoko yache pamusoro pavo vese achivaporesa. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Mashave yadobirikawo muvanhu vazinji, yachikuwa yachiti, “Ndimi Mwanakomana waMwari!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Asi iye adoyadzuma, achiyarambidza kunyaira, ndava yaiziva kuti ndiye Khirisitu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoparidza mumaSinagoge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mariko 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Pakwanga kwachena adobirika achienda kwake wega. Vanhu vadomutsvaga ndokumuwana, vadoedza kumuchengetedza kuti arege kudzovasiya. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Asi iye adoti kwavari, “Ndinofanira kuparidza Nyaya Idonaka youmambo hwaMwari kunoyamwe maguta futi, ndava ndizvo zvandidotumiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Zvino wanga achiparidza mumasinagoge yomuJudhiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodaidza Vadzidzi Vokuthanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mateo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mariko 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Zvidoitika kuti vanhu pavaimusvanikidza kuti vanzve Shoko raMwari, iye wanga adomira mumhera mogungwa roGenesareti. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Futi adoona tumwadiya tuiri pamhera pogungwa, asi vabati vohove vanga vabirika maturi vaakusuka mambure. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Achipinda munokamwe kotumwadiya, kanga kari kaSimoni, adomukumbira kuti anyedze pashoma kubva panyika. Zvino adogarikika pasi ndokudzidzisa vanhu ari mukamwadiya.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Paadopedza kutaura, adoti kuna Simoni, “Nyudzai mambure yenyu kugwiri kuti mubate.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Zvino Simoni adopindura, “Tenzi, tatambura usiku hwese asi hapanai chatabata! Asi noshoko renyu, ndichanyudza mambure.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Zvino pavadondoita zvakarezvo, vadobata hove dzidowanditsa, mambure yavo yakatoda kuparuka, <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />vadoninira abiyavo munokamwe kamwadiya kuti vauye vavabatsire. Ivo vadouya ndokuzaza tumwadiya twese tuiri, zvokuti twanga totonyura. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Asi Simoni Pita paadoona izvi, adowira pasi patsoka dzaJesu, achiti, “Birikai kwandiri, ndiri mutadzi Ishe!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Nokuti wanga washamisiwa, novese vaanga anavo, nokuwanda kwohove dzavadobata.<verse eid="LUK 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Fanikewo Jakobho naJohwani, vanakomana vaZebhedhiya, vanga vachishanda pabodzi naSimoni. Zvino Jesu adoti kuna Simoni, “Rega kucha, kubva manje uchabata vanhu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Pavadouyisa tumwadiya twavo panyika, vadosiya zvese ndokumutevera.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Murume woMapere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mariko 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Paanga ari munorimwe guta, padouya munhu wanga anomabobo muviri wese. Paadoona Jesu, adowira pasi pamberi pache ndokumuteterera achiti, “Ishe kana muchida, munogona kundinatsa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Zvino adotambanudza ruoko rache ndokumubata. Adoti kwaari, “Ndinoda, chinatsiwa.” Kabodzi nokabodzi mabobo yadobva yabirika kwaari. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Zvino adomutsindikira, kuti areke kuzvinyepa munhu asi adomuti, “Enda kozvinangidza kumuphirisita, upire chipiriso chokunatsiwa kwako sezvidoraihwa naMozisi, chive upfakazi kuvanhu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Asi zvidodaro runyerekupe pamusoro pache hudopararira, gurusvusvu rikuru ridoungana kuti rimunzve nokuporesewa hodza dzavo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Asi iye adobirika achienda kwake wega konamata.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Murume Adoputana Nhengo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mariko 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Panorimwe romazuva yakareyo, paanga achidzidzisa, panga pano vaFarisi novadzidzisi vomutemo vanga vadogarikika pakarepo, vanga vabva mumisha yese yoGaririya noJudhiya nokuJerusarema, zvino simba raIshe rokuporesa ranga riri paari. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Zvino ona, varume vadouya nomurume adotonhora nhengo ari pabonde, vadotsvaga mapindiro yavaidzoita naye kuti vamuradzike pamberi paJesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Asi nokuda kwomhomho yovanhu vadotadza kusvitsa muhwere wavo paiva naJesu, saka vadokwira padenga roimba, ndokunyandanura denga vachibva vaburutsa muhwere ari pamukhangara wache nopaboo padonangana naJesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Zvino paadoona kutenda kwavo adoti, “Muhwere, zvitadzo zvako wazviregerehwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Asi vanyori novaFarisi vadothanga kubvunzana vachiti, “Mbani iyeyu anotaura zvokushora Mwari! NdiMwari basi peno anokona kuregerera zvitema!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Jesu paadoziva zvaiva mumwoyo yavo adovapindura achiti, “Seiko muchiita mibvunzo mumwoyo yenyu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Nzvipi zvidopusa kuti, ‘Zvitema zvako zvaregerehwa,’ kana kuti, ‘Sumuka utekaire?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Asi kuti muzive kuti Mwanakomana woMunhu ano masimba panyika yokuregerera zvitema,” adoti kumurume adotonhora nhengo, “Ndinoti kwauri, sumuka, tora bonde rako, uende kumba kwako!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Kabodzi nokabodzi adosumuka pamberi pavo, achitora bonde rache, ndokuenda kumba kwache achirumbidza Mwari. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Kushamisika kudovabata vese, vadobva varumbidza Mwari, futi vadozara nokucha, vachiti, “Nasi taona zvinhu zvinoshamisa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodaidza Revhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mariko 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Mumasure mozvakarezvo adobirika, ndokuona muteresi waiitiwa Revhi, anozita rokuti Mateo, wanga adogarikika paimba yomutero. Jesu adoti kwaari, “Nditevere.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Iye adosiya zvese, ndokusumuka achimutevera.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Zvino Revhi adomuitira mabiko makuru mumba mache, ipopo panga pano vateresi vazinji novamwewo vanga vadogarikika kuti vaje pathafura naye. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Zvino vaFarisi novanyori vadonyunyutira vadzidzi vache. Vadoti kwavari, “Indava yei muchija nokumwa novateresi novatadzi?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Vapuma vanodaba chiremba, asi vanohwara ndivo vanoda chiremba. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Ndidouyaba kudzodaidza vadorurama, asi vatadzi kuti vapinduke.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo Pamusoro Pokutsanya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mariko 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Zvino vadoti kwaari, “Vadzidzi vaJohwani vanotsanya nokunamata kadowanda, futi vadzidzi vovaFarisi vanoita zvibodzi bodzizvo, asi vadzidzi venyu vanoja nokumwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Mungatsanyise vadokokewa kumuchato iye mukwende anavo chere? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Mazuva yachasvika, pachabiritsiwa mukwende kubva kwavari, pamazuva yakareyo ndipo pavachatsanya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Adovanyepawo mufananidzo ndokuti kwavari, “Hapanai anokerura kajira kubva pabiza ritsva achikasonerera pahembe yasakara. Kana akaita zvakarezvo, achakerura hembe yasakarayo, futi kajira kanobva pabiza ritsva kanotadza kuenderana nohembe yasakara. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Futi hapanai anoisa waini itsva muhomwe dzomatehwe yokare, akaita zvakarezvo waini itsva inophabura homwe dzomatehwe yokare, wainiyo yotaika, ukuwo matehwe yoparara. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Asi waini itsva inofanira kuisiwa muhomwe dzomatehwe dzitsva! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Futi hapanai anoti mumasure mokumwa waini yokare, angadzoda kumwa waini itsva, ndava anoti, ‘Yokare, ndiyo idonaka.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mubvunzo Pamusoro PoSabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mariko 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Nomusi woSabata vaitekaira nomuminda yogorosi. Vadzidzi vache vadochora hora dzogorosi, vachitsukutira mumanja vachija. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Asi vamwe vaFarisi vadoti, “Sei muchiita zvisingatendehwe kuitiwa paSabata?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Hamunai kuverenga nai zvidoitiwa naDhavhiti paanga ano nzara iye novanhu vaanga anavo? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Adopinda muimba yaMwari, achitora nokuja mazingwa yanoera, yasingabvumihwi kujiwa noumwe munhu kusiya kwokujiwa novaphirisita basi. Adopasawo vanhu vaanga anavo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Adoti kwavari, “Mwanakomana woMunhu ndiIshe woSabata.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murume Woruoko Ridoputirira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mariko 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Pano imwe Sabata Jesu adopinda musinagoge ndokudzidzisa. Makaremo manga muno umwe murume wanga anoruoko roruji rudoputana. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Vanyori novaFarisi vadomunangara kuti vaone kana waidzoporesa nomusi woSabata, kuti vawane mhosva yokudzomunenedzera. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Jesu adoziva pfungwa dzavo ndokuti kumurume wanga anoruoko ridoputana, “Uya umire pano.” Iye adosumuka ndokumira pakarepo. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Ndinokubvunzai kuti zvinobvumihwa chere kuita zvidonaka nomusi woSabata kana kuita zvidoipa, kuchidza upenyu kana kuhuparadza?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Adovanangara nangara vese, ndokuti kumurume uye, “Tambanudza ruoko rako.” Iye ndokuritambanudza, ruoko rache ndokubva rapora.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Asi ivo vadozara noukari ndokunyairirana vachitsvaga chavangamuite.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anosarudza Nhumwa Gumi Nodziiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mariko 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Mumazuva yakareyo adoenda kugomo konamata, adonamata kuna Mwari usiku hwese. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Pakwanga kwachena, adodaidza vadzidzi vache ndokusarudza gumi novairi pakati pavo, vaadotenza kuti nhumwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni waadotenza kuti Pita naAndireya waiva mukoma nomunin'ina naye, naJakobho naJohwani, naFiripi naBhatoromiyu, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />naMateo naTomasi, naJakobho mwanakomana waArufiyasi, naSimoni woushingi, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />naJudhasi mwanakomana waJakobho, naJudhasi Sikariyoti, adodzova mupanduki.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodzidzisa Nokuporesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mateo 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Adoburuka novadzidzi ndokumira panzvimbo idoenzana, wanga anomhomho ikuru yovadzidzi vache nogurusvusvu rikuru rovanhu. Vanhu vakarevo vanga vabva kwese muJudhiya nomuJerusarema nomunyasi mogungwa roTire noSidhoni, vanga vauya kudzomunzva nokudzoporesewa matenda yavo, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />noavo vaitambudziwa nomweya idoipa vadoporesewa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Ipopo mhomho yese yovanhu vadovavarira kumubata, ndava simba raibirika kubva paari richivaporesa vese.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zvinouyisa Mufaro kana Kusuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mateo 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Adonangara vadzidzi vache ndokuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mudokomborehwa imipa varombo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">ndava umambo hwaMwari ngwenyu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Mudokomborehwa imipa vanonzva nzara manje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ndava muchagutsiwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Mudoropafadziwa imipa vanorira manje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ndava muchaseka.”<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Mudokomborehwa imipa kana vanhu vachikuvengai, vachikusiyai kunze nokukuzvidzai, vachisvipisa mazita yenyu, nokuda kwoMwanakomana woMunhu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Farai pazuva rakarero, nokuchiruka nomufaro, ndava mubairo wenyu mukuru kudenga. Ndava zvakarezvo ndizvo zvidoitiwa nomadzibaba yavo kuvaporofiti.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Asi mayanga kwamuri vadopfuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">ndava matotambira kunyaradziwa kwenyu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Mayanga kwamuri imipa mudoguta iye manje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ndava muchanzva nzara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Mayanga kwamuri imipa munoseka nguwa ino, ndava</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">mucharira nokuungudza.”<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Mayanga kwamuri, kana vanhu vese vachitaura zvidonaka pamusoro penyu, ndava madzibaba yavo vadoita zvakarezvo kuvaporofiti vomabhwodo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idai Vavengi Venyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mateo 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7:12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Asi ndinoti kwamuri imipa munonzva, Idai vavengi venyu, itirai zvidonaka vanokuzondai, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />ropafadzai vanokushurikidzai, munamatire vanokubatai uyanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Anokurova padama, perekera rimwe kamu, noanokutorera bhachi, mureke atore nohembe kamu. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Perekai kuno wese anokuruvirai, kana paita anokutorerai zvinhu zvenyu, rekai kudzomubvunza pakare kuti akudzotserei. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Saka zvamunoda kuti vanhu vakuitirei muvaitire imimi zvakarezvo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Kana muchindoda vanokudai, nghupi kutendewa kwamunako? Nokuti novatadzi vanodawo vaye vanovada. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Futi kana mukaitira zvidonaka kuno avo vanokuitirai zvidonaka, munowana mubairo wei? Ndava novatadzi vanoita zvibodzibodzizvo! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Kana muchindokweretesa vamunogurupira kuti vachakudzotserai, munotendehwei? Nokuti vatadzi vanokweretesa vavanogurupira kuti vachavadzotsera pakamu zvavadovakweretesa. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Asi imimi idai vavengi venyu, muvaitire zvidonaka, ipai pasinai chamunogurupira kudzotsehwa, mubairo wenyu uchava mukuru, ipopo muchava vana voWokumusorosoro, nokuti iye anotsitsi kuno vasingatende nokuno vanondozvifunga. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Ivai notsitsi fanike Baba venyu vanotsitsi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutonga Vamwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mateo 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Rekai kutonga, kuti murege kutongewawo, rekai kupasa mhosva, kuti murege kudzopiwawo mhosva, regererai, kuti muregerehwewo. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Pasai, naimipa muchapasiwawo. Mhimo idonaka, idotsindihwa, idozunguzihwa, inomupororo, ichadururihwa pabuthu penyu. Nokuti mhimo yamunopasa ndiyo mhimo yamuchadzotsehwawo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Adovanyepawo mufananidzo achiti, “Rombe rinokonaba kutungamira rimwe rombe, ndava vakatungamirirana, vese vanowira mugomba. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Mudzidzi haakunde mudzidzisi wache, asi wese anenge adzidzisiwa zvidokwana, anofanana nomudzidzisi wache.”<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Sei uchiona kasesu kari muziso rohama yako, asi usingaone danda riri muziso rako? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Kana kuti ungaudze tini hama yako kuti, ‘Hama, reka ndibiritse kasesu kari muziso rako,’ iwewe usingaone danda riri muziso rako? Iwe munyengeri, thanga kubiritsa danda riri muziso rako, kuti udzonatsa kuona mabiritsiro yokasesu kari muziso rohama yako.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muti Nomichero Yawene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mateo 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Ndava hapanai muti udonaka unobereka muchero udoipa, kana nomuti udoipa unobereka muchero udonaka. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Ndava muti wese unozikana nomuchero wawene, nokuti huyu dzinothanziwaba pamwinza, kana mazambiringa yanothanziwaba padzambwa romwinza. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Munhu adonaka anobiritsa zvinhu zvidonaka kubva pamwoyo wache udonaka, nomunhu adoipa anobiritsa zvidoipa kubva pamwoyo wache udoipa. Ndava muromo unonyaira zvidozara mumwoyo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vavakhi Vodzimba Vairi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mateo 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Munondidaidzirei kuti, ‘Ishe, Ishe,’ musingaite zvandinokunyepai? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Wese anouya kwandiri akanzva mashoko yangu nokuyaita, ndichakunangidzai waadofanana naye. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Adofanana nomunhu anovakha imba, adochera zvokuti gwiri, wovakhira nheyo paruware, kahwizi pakadofashukira mafashamu yadorova imba yakareyo, asi hayanai kuigwetedza nokuti yanga idovakhiwa zvidosimba. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Asi anonzva asingayaiti adofanana nomunhu adovakha imba yache pajecha pasinai nheyo, mafashamu payadorova imba yakareyo idowa nokamangu futi kuparara kwayene kwanga kudokuritsa.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu Anorapa Muranda Womukuru Wozana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mateo 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Paadopedza kutaura uku kwese vanhu vachinzva adopinda muKaperenaume. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Zvino mukuru wozana romauto wanga ano muranda waikosha kwaari, wanga achihwara zvokutoda kupfa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Paadonzva nozvaJesu, adotuma kwaari vakuru vovaJudha achimukumbira kuuya kudzoporesa muranda wache. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Pavadosvika kuna Jesu, vadomuteterera chaizvo vachiti, “Adokodzera kuti mumuitire zvakarezvi, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />nokuti anoda rudzi redu, futi adotivakhira sinagoge redu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Zvino Jesu adoenda navo. Paanga wava papfupi nopamumba mukuru wozana romauto adotumira shamwari dzache kwaari, dzidobva dzati kwaari, “Ishe rekai zvenyu kuzvinetsa. Ndava ndinokodzeraba kuti muuye mumba mangu, <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />naizvozvo naininiwo ndinotarisiraba kuuya kwakareko. Asi ndonyairai shoko basi, muranda wangu anopora. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Nokuti naininiwo ndiri munhu anomasimba, ndino mauto yari pasi pangu. Ndinoti kuno umwe, ‘Enda kwakati!’ Iye woenda, nokuno umwe, ‘Uya kuno!’ Iye wouya, nokumuranda wangu, ‘Ita chakati!’ Iye woita.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Jesu paadonzva zvakarezvi adoshamisika naye, ndokuchungunukira kugurusvusvu rovanhu vaimutevera achiti kwavari, “Ndinokunyepai kuti, handinai kuona kutenda kudodai kunyange pakati povaIzirairi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Zvino vanga vatumiwa pavadodzoka kumba, vadowana muranda wapora.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumutsiwa kwoMwanakomana Womujiche paNaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Zvidoitika pazuva ridotevera kuti adoenda muguta raiitiwa Naini, vadzidzi vache nomhomho ikuru vadoenda naye. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Waakusvika panyasi posuwo roguta, padoita murume wanga wapfa wanga adotakuhwa kuendesewa kunze. Wanga ari mwanakomana mubodzi wamaache, vanga variwo mujiche, mhomho ikuru yomuguta yanga iri pabodzi nomujicheyo. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Ishe paadomuona, adomunzvira tsitsi ndokuti kwaari, “Rega kurira.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Adosvika ndokubata mukhangara, vatakuri vadomira kuti puru. Zvino iye adoti, “Jaha, ndinoti kwauri, muka.” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Futi nyakupfa adobva wagarikika, ndokuthanga kutaura. Iye adomupereka kuna maache.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Kucha kudovabata vese, vadobva varumbidza Mwari, vachiti, “Muporofiti mukuru wamuka pakati pedu! Uye Mwari wabvakachira vanhu vake!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Nyaya pamusoro pache idopararira muJudhiya rese nomatunhu yadopoteredza.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhume Dzidobva Kuna Johwani Muombeki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mateo 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Vadzidzi vaJohwani vadomunyepa zvinhu zvakarezvi zvese, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />iye adodaidza vadzidzi vache vairi kuti vaenda kuna Ishe kobvunza kuti, “Ndimi chere waidzouya, kana kuti kuri kuuya umwe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Zvino varume vaye pavadosvika kwaari vadoti, “Tatumiwa naJohwani Muombeki kudzobvunza kuti, ndimi chere waidzouya kana kuti kuri kuuya umwe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Panguwa yakareyo adorapa vazinji pamatenda yavo nomadzudzo nomweya idoipa, uye marombe mazinji adoyasvinudza. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Zvino adovapindura achiti, “Endai konyepa Johwani zvamaona nokunzva, zvokuti marombe yari kuona, vadotonhora nhengo vari kutekaira, vanomabobo vari kunatsiwa, nomaburunzeve yari kunzva, vadopfa vari kumutsiwa, varombo vari kuparidzihwa nyaya idonaka. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Adokomborehwa asingagumbuhwe nainini!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Nhume dzaJohwani padzidoenda, adothanga kunyaira kugurusvusvu pamusoro paJohwani achiti, “Chii chamudoenda koona kusango, Mudoenda koona tsanga yaigwetedzewa nomhepo chere? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Chii zvino chamudoenda koona? Mudoenda koona munhu adosimira hembe dzinodhura chere? Handiti vanosimira hembe dzinodhura vari mudzimba dzomadzimambo! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Chii manje chamudoenda koona? Muporofiti chere? Inde, ndinokunyepai kuti anokunda muporofiti. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Wakareyu ndiye adonyohwa nozvache kuti, ‘Ona, ndinotuma nhume yangu pamberi pako, achanhadzira nzira yako.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Ndinokunyepai kuti, pakati povadozvahwa novakadzi hapanai anokurira Johwani. Asi mudikidiki muumambo hwaMwari ndiye mukuru kwaari.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Pavadonzva zvakarezvo vanhu vese novateresi vadokudza Mwari, nokuti vanga vaombekewa noruombeko raJohwani, <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />asi vaFarisi nomagweta vadoramba zano raMwari kwavari, nokusaombekewa naye.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />“Nzvipi manje zvandingaenzanise nazvo vanhu vonguwa ino, vadofanana nani? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Vadofanana novana vadogarikika pamusika, vanodaidzirana vachiti, ‘Tidokuridzirai chinonje, asi hamunai kutamba, tidokuridzirai mhere asi hamunai kurira.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Nokuti Johwani Muombeki adouya asingaje mazingwa, kana kumwa waini, asi imimi munoti, ‘Anoshave!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwanakomana woMunhu adouya, achija nokumwa, asi imimi mudoti, ‘Onai! Nyanhafu nomuraradzi, shamwari yovateresi novatadzi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Asi uchenjeri hunoruramisiwa novana vahwene vese.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Kumba kwaSimoni muFarisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Umwe muFarisi adomukumbira kuja naye, zvino adopinda mumba momuFarisi, ndokutora nzvimbo yake patafura. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Zvino mukadzi womuguta rakarero, wanga ari mutadzi, paadoziva kuti Jesu wanga ari pathafura mumba momuFarisi, adouya noguchu romapfuta, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />adomira mumasure maJesu kutsoka dzache, achirira, ndokuthanga kutotesa tsoka dzaJesu nomisodzi yache, achidzipukuta novhudzi romusoro wache, achitsvoda tsoka dzache, nokudzizora mapfuta. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Zvino muFarisi nyakukokera Jesu paadozviona, adotaurira mumwoyo achiti, “Dai munhu uyu waiva muporofiti, waitoziva zvidoita mukadzi ari kumubata, nokuti mutadzi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Jesu achipindura adoti kwaari, “Simoni, ndinochokutaura kwauri.” Iye adopindura, “Mudzidzisi, taurai”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“Umwe mupi wozvikwerete anga ano vakwereti vairi, umwe adokwereta mazana mashano yomadhenari, umwewo makumi mashano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Pavadotadzirira kubhadhara, iye adovarekerera vese. Zvino ngupi kwavari achanyanya kumuda?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni adopindura achiti, “Ndinofunga kuti nguye adorekerehwa zvidowanda.” Adoti kwaari, “Watonga zvidonaka.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ipopo achichungunuka kumukadzi adoti kuna Simoni, “Uri kuona chere mukadzi uyu? Ndapinda mumba mako, haunai kundipasa mvura yotsoka dzangu, asi iye watotesa tsoka dzangu nomisodzi yache achidzipukuta novhudzi rache. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Iwewe haunai kunditsvoda, asi kubva nguwa yandapinda haanai kurega kutsvoda tsoka dzangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Haunai kuzora mapfuta musoro wangu, asi iyeyu wazora tsoka dzangu mapfuta. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Ndinokuudza ndipo kuti, zvitadzo zvache zvizinji zvarekerehwa, nokuti iye adoda maninge, asi uyo adorekerehwa zvishoma, anodawo pashoma.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Adobva wati kumukadzi, “Zvitema zvako zvarekerehwa.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Zvino vanga vanaye pathafura vadothanga kunyairirana vachiti, “Ko iyeyu mbani, anotorekererawo zvitadzo?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Zvino adoti kumukadzi, “Kutenda kwako kwakuponesa, enda zvako murunyararo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Vakadzi Vaitenairira Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi adoenda kumaguta nokumisha, achiparidza nokuuya noNyaya Idonaka youmambo hwaMwari. Vanogumi novairi vanga vanaye, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />novamwe vakadzi vadosununguhwa kumweya idoipa nohodza, Mariya Magadharina, adobiritsiwa mashave manomwe, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />naJoana mukadzi waChuza, mutariri waHerudhe, naSuzana novamwewo vazinji vaivapasa zvavaiwana kubva pakubata kwavo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo Womujari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mariko 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Zvino gurusvusvu rikuru ridouya kwaari richibva kumaguta yadosiyana siyana, iye adonyaira kwavari nomifananidzo.<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />Adoti kwavari, “Mujari adoenda kojara mbeu dzache. Paanga achijara, dzimwe dzidombwerera munzira, ndokutsikiwa notsoka notushiri tudobva twadzija. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Dzimwe dzidombwerera pamabhwe, padzidomera, dzidooma ndava panga pasinai munyonho. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Dzimwe dzidombwerera pamwinza, mwinza idokura pabodzi nadzo ndokudzivhinga. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Dzimwe dzidombwerera paivhu ridonaka, ndokukura dzichibereka zvibereko, zvidopetewa kazana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Paainyaira zvakarezvi adodaidzira achiti, “Anonzeve, mbaatetekere anzve!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinangwa choMifananidzo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mariko 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Zvino vadzidzi vache pavadomubvunza zvairehwa nomufananidzo wakareyu, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />adoti kwavari, “Imimi mudopasiwa kuziva zvidohwanda zvoumambo hwaMwari, asi kuno vamwe zviri mumifananidzo, kuitira kuti pakuona vareke kuonetsetsa, nopakunzva vareke kunzvitsitsa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anovaudza Zvinoreva Mufananidzo Womujari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mariko 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Zvino mufananidzo nguyu, mbeu ndiro shoko raMwari. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Dziye dzidombwerera munzira mbaye vadonzva, zvino jabhurosi anouya achitora shoko mumwoyo yavo kuti vareke kutenda vachidzoponesewa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Dzidombwerera pamabhwe mbaye vanoti kana vanzva shoko vanoritambira nomufaro. Asi havanai midzi, vanotenda kwokanguwa kapfupi, panouya muyedzo vanowa. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Zvino mbeu dzidombwerera pamwinza mbaye vanonzva shoko, asi mukurarama kwavo vodzovhingiwa nokuita kwavo hanya nozvonyika, nopfuma futi nomafaro youpenyu, saka havadzoita zvibereko zvidosvika. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Kana dziri dzopaivhu ridonaka mbaye vanonzva shoko voribatitsitsa nomwoyo udonaka udotendeka, voita zvibereko nokutsungirira.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwenje Pasi poDengu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mariko 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Hapanai anoti kana wabatidza mwenje anoubvinihira kana kuuisa pasi pobonde. Asi anotouisa pachigadziko kuti vanopinda vavhenekehwe nochiedza.<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Nokuti hapanai chidosvisviwa chisingadzobiritsiwa pachenu, futi hapanai chidohwanziwa chisingadzozikana kana kudzoisiwa pachiedza.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Chenjererai ndipo, manzviro yamunoita, nokuti kuno anazvo achapasiwa zvimwe, asi asinai nochaanofungacho kuti anacho achatorehwa peno.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amai Novanin'ina vaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mariko 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Zvino amaache novanin'ina vache vadouya kwaari, asi havanai kugona kusvika paari nokuda kwomhomho. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Zvino umwe adomunyepa achiti, “Amai venyu novanin'ina venyu vadokumirirai panze, vari kuda kukuonai.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Asi iye adoti kwavari, “Amaangu novanin'ina vangu mbaye vanonzva shoko raMwari nokuriita.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodekhadza Duthu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mariko 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Rimwe zuva adopinda mukamwadiya novadzidzi vache ndokuti kwavari, “Mbatiyambukirei kumhiri kwogungwa.” Saka vadobva vathanga kuenda. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Pavaikhwasva kamwadiya, Jesu adobva waenzera zvache. Zvino duthu rikuru ridouya pagungwa, kamwadiya ndokuthanga kuzara nomvura, zvokuti vanga vaapanjodzi. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Vadoenda komumutsa vachiti, “Tenzi, Tenzi taakupfa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Iye adomuka ndokudzuma duthu nomapfeni yogungwa yanga yachipenga, yadobva yarosa, ndokubva kwadekhara. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Adoti kwavari, “Kutenda kwenyu kuri poi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Asi ivo vadocha futi vadoshamisika, ndokunyairirana vachiti, “Ko munhu wakareyu mbani? Anototeerehwa kana wadzuma duthu nomapfeni yogungwa!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anoporesa Munhu Wokugahwa noMashave</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mariko 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Zvino vadosvika kunyika yovaGarasa, idonangarana noGaririya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Achindobirika mukamwadiya achisvika panyika, adokumana nomurume waibva muguta, anga adopotehwa nomashave. Wanga asingasimire mbacha kwonguwa irefu futi wanga asingagare mumba asi mumakuwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Paadoona Jesu adodaidzira nodzinga ropamusoro, ndokuwira pasi pamberi pache achiti, “Chii chamunoda kuita nainini, imi Jesu, Mwanakomana waMwari Wokumusorosoro? Ndinokukumbirai kuti murege kunditambudza.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Nokuti wanga waraira mweya woutsambwa kuti ubirike mumurume wakareyo. Nokuti kwonguwa irefu wanga udomubata, waigara adochengetewa, adosungiwa manja nomakumbo nongetani, asi iye waidimura wotungamihwa noshave racho kusango, kunzvimbo dzache wega.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Zvino Jesu adomubvunza achiti, “Zita rako ndiwe yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Iye adoti, “Rigiyoni,” nokuti mashave mazinji yanga yapinda maari. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Mashave yadodzomukumbira kuti areke kuyaraira kuenda kugomba risingagon'e.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Zvino boka rikuru rohumba ranga richifura mumhera mogomo, mashave yadokumbira Jesu kuti ayabvumire kupinda madziri. Iye ndokuyabvumidza. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Ipopo mashave yadobirika mumurume yachipinda muhumba, zvino boka ridotizirana kumapiripiri dzichiwirira mugungwa ndokupfira makaremo.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Anyakabusa pavadoona zvanga zvaitika, vadotiza, ndokuzvinyepa muguta nomumisha. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Ipopo vanhu vadobirika koona zvanga zvaitika, vadosvika panga pana Jesu, ndokuwana murume adobiritsiwa mashave, adogarikika patsoka dzaJesu, adotosimira wava nopfungwa kwadzo, vachibva vacha. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Vaye vanga vazviona vadovanyepa maponesehwo yadoitiwa iye wanga ano mashave. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Zvino vanhu vese vonyika idopoteredza yovaGarasa vadomukumbira kuti abve kwavari, ndava vanga vabatiwa nokucha kukuru, saka adopinda mukamwadiya ndokudzokera. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Murume wokubiritsiwa mashave adokumbira kuti ave naye, asi adomuendesa achiti,<verse eid="LUK 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Dzoka kumba kwenyu wozivisa zvikuru zvawaitihwa naMwari.” Iye adoenda, achiudza guta rese zvinhu zvikuru zvaadoitihwa naJesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanasikana WaJairosi noMukadzi Waibirika Gazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mariko 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Zvino Jesu paadodzoka, mhomho yovanhu idomutambira, nokuti vese vanga vadotomumirira. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Zvino padodzouya murume waiitiwa Jairosi, wanga ari mukuru wosinagoge, achizviwisira pasi patsoka dzaJesu adomuteterera kuti aende kumba kwake. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Nokuti anga ano mwanasikana mubodzi, wanga ano makore gumi nomairi, wanga waakutandadza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Paanga achienda vanhu vaibva kumativi yese vadomusvanikidza. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Zvino mukadzi wanga achibirika magazi kwomakore gumi nomairi pasinai waikona kumurapa, <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />adouya nomumasure make ndokubata mukombero wojasi rache, kabodzinokabodzi magazi yadomira kubirika. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Jesu adobva wati, “Mbani wandibata?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Asi vese vadozviramba, Pita adoti, “Tenzi, mhomho iri kukuguma-gumai futi ichikutsvikinyidzai!”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Asi Jesu adoti, “Pano munhu wandibata, nokuti ndanzva simba richibirika mandiri.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Mukadzi paadoona kuti haanai kuhwanda, adouya achitetemera, adozviwisira pasi pamberi pache ndokumuudza pamberi povanhu vese chikonzero chaadomubatira, nomaporesehwo yaadoitiwa kabodzinokabodzi. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Jesu adobva wati, “Mwanasikana, kutenda kwako kwakuporesa, enda murunyararo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Jesu achiri kutaura murume adobva kumba kwomutungamiri ndokusvika achiti, “Chirekai kushupa Mudzidzisi, nokuti mwanasikana wenyu watopfa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Asi Jesu paadozvinzva adomupindura achiti, “Reka kucha. Tenda basi, achapora.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Jesu paadosvika kumba, haanai kubvumira vamwe vanhu kupinda kusiya kwaPita, Jakobho naJohwani nababa naamai vomusikana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Vese vanga vachimurira maundu, Jesu adovati, “Rekai kurira, haanai kupfa, adondoenzera basi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Vadobva vamuseka, nokuti vanga vachiziva kuti wapfa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Asi adobata ruoko rake achiti, “Mwana muka.” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Mweya wake udobva wadzoka, achibva wamuka pakarepo, adovaraira kuti vamupase chokuja. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Ipopo vabereki vache vadoshamisika nazvo, asi adovakohomedza kuti varege kuwana wavanoudza zvanga zvaitika.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu Anotuma Vadzidzi Gumi Novairi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mariko 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Zvino adodaidza vanogumi novairi, ndokuvapasa simba nochikuriri pamusoro pomashave yese, nokuporesa zvihwere, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />ipopo adovatuma koparidza umambo hwaMwari nokuporesa. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Adoti kwavari, “Regai kutakura chinhu, tsvimbo, nhava, mbuva, kana mari pahwendo hwenyu, regedzai kutakura zvokusimira zviirizviiri. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Mumba yamunenge mapinda garai makaremo, kusvikira mabirika. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Kwese kwavasingakutambirei, kana maakubirika muguta rakarero, kuhumurai pfumbi rotsoka dzenyu kuti huve upfakazi hunovaroverera.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Saka vadodzobirika ndokuenda nomumamisha vachiparidza vhangeri nokuporesa kwesekwese.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukanganisika kwaHerudhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mariko 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Zvino Herudhe, mutongi, paadonzva zvese zvidoitiwa, adonetseka nazvo, nokuti vamwe vaiti Johwani wanga wamuka kuvadopfa, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />vamwe ndovaiti, Eriya waonekwa, vamwewo vachiti umwe wovaporofiti vokare wamuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Herudhe adoti, “Johwani ndidomugwata musoro, manje mbani iyeyu wandaakunzva waakuita zvesezvi?” Saka Herudhe adotsvaga kumuona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Anogutsa Zviuru Zvishano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mariko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Johwani 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Nhumwa pavadodzoka vadoudza Jesu zvese zvavanga vaita. Iye adoenda navo pavo vega kuguta raiitiwa Bhetisaidha. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Asi mhomho paidozviziva idomutevera, iye adovatambira ndokuvanyepa zvoumambo hwaMwari achirapa vaye vanga vachida kuporesewa. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Pakwanga kwaakudoka, vanogumi novairi vadouya ndokuti kwaari, “Kototsai vanhu, kuti vaende mumisha nomunzvimbo dzidopoteredza, kwavangawane zvokuja, ndava tiri musango.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Asi iye adoti kwavari, “Imipa vapasei zvavangaje.” Ivo vadoti, “Hatinai zvinopfuura mazingwa mashano nohove dziiri, kunze kwokuti titoenda kotengera vanhu vakareva vese zvokuja.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Ndava panga pano vanhurume vaitosvika zviuru zvishano. Zvino adoti kuvadzidzi vake, “Garisai vanhu muzvikwata zvomakumi mashano.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Vadoita izvozvo, ndokugarisa vanhu vese pasi <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Adotora mazingwa mashano nohove dziiri ndokunangara kudenga, achizvikomborera nokuzvikomorakomora achipasa vadzidzi vache kuti vazvipase vanhu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Vese vadoja vachiguta. Vadodzounganidza zvidosara, ndokuzadza tsvanda gumi nodziiri dzozvimepfu.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita Anopupura Kuti Jesu ndiMesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mateo 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mariko 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Zvino zvidoitika kuti paanga achinamata wega vadzidzi vadouya, iye adovabvunza kuti, “Ko vanhu vanoti ndini yani?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Ivo vadopindura vachiti, “Johwani Muombeki, asi vamwewo vanoti Eriya, kwodzoitawo vanoti ngumwe wovaporofiti vokare wamuka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Ko imimi munoti ndini yani?” Pita adobva wati, “Ndimi Khirisitu waMwari.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotaura Zvokutambudziwa kwache nozvoIpfa yache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mateo 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mariko 8:30—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Asi adovaraira achivakohomedza kuti vareke kuzvitaurira munhu, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />zvino adoti, “Mwanakomana woMunhu anofanira kutambudziwa pazvinhu zvizinji nokurambiwa novakuru vovanhu, novaphirisita vakuru, novanyori, wobaiwa, wodzomuka pazuva rochitatu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Adobva waudza vese achiti, “Kana munhu achida kuuya mumasure mangu, mbaazvirambe atore muchinjikwa wache mazuva ese anditevere. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Nokuti wese anoda kuchidza upenyu hwache achataikihwa nahwo, nowese anotaikihwa noupenyu hwache nokuda kwangu, achahuchidza. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Nokuti chii chichabatsira munhu kana akawana nyika yese iye achitaika kana kuzvitaya? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Ndava wese anondinyara inini nomashoko yangu, wakareyo Mwanakomana womunhu achamunyarawo paanouya mukubhwinya kwache nokubhwinya kwaBaba vache nokwongirozi dzitsvene. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Ndinokuudzai chokwadi kuti varipo vadomira pano vasingadzoraidza ipfa vasati vaona umambo hwaMwari.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubhwinya kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mateo 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mariko 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Kwapera mazuva yanenge masere yokunyaihwa kwozvakarezvi adotora Pita, naJohwani naJakobho, achikwira mugomo konamata. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Paanga wakunamata chiso chache chidosanduka, hembe dzache dzidochena zvokuyetima kunge kupenya kwokambarivari. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Zvino varume vairi, Mozisi naEriya vadooneka vachinyaira naye, futi vanga vanokubhwinya kukuru. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Vadonyaira pamusoro pokuenda kwache kwaaidzozazisa kuJerusarema. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Pita naabiyake vaanga anavo vadobatiwa nohope dzidonyanya, asi pavadodzopengenuka, vadoona kubhwinya kwache, novarume vairi vadomira naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Zvidoitika pavanga vaakuparadzana naye, Pita adoti kuna Jesu, “Tenzi, zvidonaka kuti tiri pano, mbatiitei misakasira mitatu, umwe wenyu, umwe waMozisi noumwe waEriya,” asingazivi zvaaitaura.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Paanga achinyaira zvakarezvi guti ridouya ndokuvafukidza, vadocha pavanga vaamuguti. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Izvi ridobirika mugutimo richiti, “Wakareyu ndiye Mwanakomana wangu, Musaruhwa wangu, mutetekerei!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Izvi paridonyaira, Jesu adodzoonewa waawega. Vadoramba vadozvinyarara zvakarezvo mumazuva iyoyo, hapanai munhu wavadonyepa chinhu pamusoro pozvavadoona.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Mukomana wanga Anomweya udoipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mateo 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mariko 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Mangwana chimuka, vaburuka mugomo, mhomho ikuru idosangana naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Padoita murume wanga ari mumhomho, adodaidzira Jesu achiti, “Mudzidzisi, ndapota, ndionereiwo mwanakomana wangu, nokuti ndiye chete mwana wangu! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Shave rinomubata, woerekana wathanga kukuwa, rinomugwetedza nosimba kusvikira waakuphupha furu. Anobva wati raphatha, risingamusiye kamangu, futi riri kutomuparadza. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ndakumbira vadzidzi venyu kuti varibiritse, asi varitadzirira.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Imi vanhu vonguwa ino vasingatende, vadotaika, ndichava naimimi nokuva nomwoyo murefu naimimi kusvikira rini? Ndichakubatsirai kusvikira riniko? Uya nomwanakomana wako pano.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Paanga achiuya shave ridomuumburudza richimugwetedza nosimba. Asi Jesu adokaruza mweya wotsambwa, ndokuporesa mukomana, nokumupereka kuna baba vache. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Vese vadoshamisika nokuona ukuru hwaMwari. Zvino vachiri kushamisika nozvese zvaadoita, adotaura kuvadzidzi vache.<verse eid="LUK 9:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotaura Pakare Zvoipfa Yache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mariko 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />Adoti, “Mazvi yakareya mbayapinde munzeve dzenyu, ndava Mwanakomana womunhu achaisiwa mumaoko yovanhu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Asi ivo havanai kunzvitsitsa kutaura kwakareku, futi kwanga kudosvisvika kwavari, kuti vareke kuzvibata, asi vadocha kumubvunza nyaya yakareyo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukuru Wovese Mbani?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mariko 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Zvino nharo dzidomuka pakati pavo dzokuti mbani mukuru pakati pavo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Asi Jesu paadoziva kufunga kwomwoyo yavo, adotora mwana ndokumugadzika panyasi pache, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />adoti kwavari, “Wese anotambira mwana uyu muzita rangu anotambira inini, noanonditambira anotambirawo adondituma, ndava mudiki pakati penyu mese, ndiye mukuru.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wese Asingakupikisei Ngwenyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mariko 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Johwani adobva wati, “Tenzi, taona munhu achidzinga mashave muzita renyu, tamurambidza, ndava haakuteverei pabodzi naisisu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Asi Jesu adoti kwaari, “Rekai kumurambidza, nokuti asingapikisane naimimi ngwenyu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musha wovaSamariya Udoramba Kutambira Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Padosvika nguwa yokuti iye atambihwe kudenga, adozvigadzirira kuenda kuJerusarema. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Adotuma nhume mberi kwake, idzo dzidoenda ndokupinda mumusha wovaSamariya, kuti vamugadzirire. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Asi vanhu havanai kumutambira nokuti wanga achitoenda kuJerusarema. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Zvino vadzidzi vake Jakobho naJohwani pavadozviona, vadoti, “Tenzi, munoda chere kuti tikumbire moto ubve kudenga uvaparadze?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Asi iye adochununguka ndokuvadzuma. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Zvino vadoenda kuno umwe musha.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanoda Kuva Vateveri vaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mateo 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Pavaifamba munzira, umwe murume adoti kwaari, “Ndichakuteverai kwese kwamunoenda.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Makava yanomisina, notushiri tuno tushashira, asi Mwanakomana woMunhu haanai pokutsamidza musoro wake.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Kunoumwe adoti, “Nditevere.” Asi iye adoti, “Ishe, rekai ndithange ndaviga baba vangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Asi iye adoti kwaari, “Reka vadopfa vavikhe vadopfa vavo, asi iwewe enda koparidza umambo hwaMwari.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Umwewo adoti, “Ndichakuteverai, Ishe, asi rekai ndithange ndagoneka vari kumba.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Hapanai anoti kana waisa janja rache pagejo wodzocheuka anganzi adofanira muumambo hwaMwari.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotuma Vanomakumi Manomwe Novairi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi Ishe adomisikidza vanomakumi manomwe, ndokuvatuma kuenda mberi kwache, vari vairivairi, kumaguta yese nokunzvimbo dzaaidzoenda pachake. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Adoti kwavari, “Goho ridowanditsa, asi vashandi vashoma, motonamata kuti Ishe muridzi wogoho atumire vashandi kugoho rake. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Pindai munzira, onai, ndinokutumai sehwayana pakati pomasvitsi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Rekai kutakura chikwama, kana buthu rozvinhu, kana shangu, rekai kumoresa munhu panzira. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Paimba yese yamunopinda, thangai kuti, ‘Rugare mbarive muimba ino!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Kana mwanakomana worugare ari pakarepo, rugare renyu ruchagara paari, asi kana asipo, ruchadzoka kwamuri. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Rambai muri mumba makaremo, muchija nokumwa zvamunopasiwa, nokuti mushandi anokodzero yomuripo wache, regai kuenda imba noimba. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Pese pamunopinda muguta vachikutambirai, ijai zvinoisiwa pamberi penyu, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />poresai vahwere vari makaremo moti kwavari, ‘Umambo hwaMwari hwanyedza kwamuri.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Asi kwese kwamunopinda muguta vasingakutambirei, endai mumigwagwa yarene moti kwariri, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Kana nopfumbi roguta renyu ranamira patsoka dzedu, tinorikuhumurira kwamuri, zvisinei zivai kuti, umambo hwaMwari hwauya papfupi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ndinokuudzai, pazuva rakarero zvichanyanya kurerukira Sodhoma kupinda guta rakarero.”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maguta Yasinai Kutenda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mateo 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Mayanga kwauri, Korazini! Mayanga kwauri, Bhetisaidha! Ndava dai mabasa yosimba yadoitiwa mauri, yadoitiwa muThire nomuSidhoni, dai vadopinduka kare kare, vadototi mvocha murota vadosimira masaga. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Asi Tire noSidhoni vacharerukihwa pakutongewa kupinda imimi. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Naiwewe Kaperenaume, uchasumudzihwa kudzuru chere? Uchaburutsihwa kuHadhesi. <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Uyo anokunzvai anonzva inini, noanokurambai anorambawo inini, noanondiramba anorambawo adondituma.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanomakumi Manomwe Novairi Vanodzoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Vanomakumi manomwe vadodzoka nomufaro, vachiti, “Ishe, kana mashave yanga yachizviisa pasi pedu muzita renyu!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Zvino adoti kwavari, “Ndidoona Sathani achiwa kubva kudenga kunge mheni. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Onai, ndidokupasai chikuriri chokutsika pamusoro ponyoka nomarize, kuti muve pamusoro pomasimba yese yomuvengi, futi hapanai chichakukuwadzai. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Zvisinei regai kufara nozvakarezvi, zvokuti mweya inokuchai, asi farirai kuti mazita yenyu yadonyohwa kudenga.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anofara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mateo 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Muawa ibodziyo adofara muMweya Mutsvene ndokuti, “Ndinokutendai, Baba, Ishe wodenga nonyika, kuti mudohwandisa zvinhu zvakarezvi kuno vadochenjera novanonzvitsitsa futi mudozviisa pachenu kuvana, Inde, Baba, ndava zvakarezvo ndizvo zvidova kuda kwenyu kwonyasha.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Zvinhu zvese zvidopasiwa kwandiri naBaba vangu, futi hapanai anoziva kuti Mwanakomana mbani kusiya kwaBaba, kana kuti Baba mbani kunze kwoMwanakomana nowese anenge asaruriwa noMwanakomana kuti amuisire pachenu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Zvino adochunungukira kuvadzidzi vache ndokuvanyepa zvidovanzika achiti, “Yadokomborehwa meso yanoona zvamuri kuona! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ndava ndinokunyepai kuti vaporofiti vazinji nomadzimambo vaida kuona zvamuri kuona, asi vadozvionaba, nokunzva zvamuri kunzva, asi vadozvinzvaba.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo womuSamariya Adonaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Zvino gweta, ridosumuka richimuedza richiti, “Mudzidzisi, chii chandingaite kuti ndigare nhaka youpenyu husingapere?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Adoti kwaari, “Chii chidonyohwa mumutemo? Unoverenga tini?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Futi adopindura achiti, “‘Unofanira kuda Ishe Mwari wako nomwoyo wako wese, nomweya wako wese, nosimba rako rese, nokufunga kwako kwese, nokuda muvakhidzani wako sekuda kwaunozviita.’”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Futi adoti kwaari, “Wapindura zvidokohoroka, enda woita zvakarezvi, urarame.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Asi iye, achida kuzviita munatsi, adoti kuna Jesu, “Mabiyangu wacho mbani?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Jesu adopindura achiti, “Murume waiburuka kubva kuJerusarema achienda kuJeriko, adobatiwa nomakororo, yadomusunhura nokumurova, nokumukuwadza vachibva vaenda vachimusiya wakomoka. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Zvino muphirisita waitekairawo nonzira yakareyo, paadoona murume wakareyo adotsambuka achimutsemba. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />MuRevhiwo, paadosvika pakarepo achiona, adotsambuka achimutsemba kamu. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Asi muSamariya, wanga ari pahwendo, paadosvika paanga ari, paadomuona, adomunzvira tsitsi, <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />adoenda paari, ndokudira mapfuta nowaini pazvironda zvache, achizvipomberera, achibva wamukwidza paburu rache, achimuendesa kuimba yovarendo, kwaadomuchengetera. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Mangwana yacho adobiritsa madhinari yake mairi achiyapasa muchengeti woimba yovarendo, achiti, ‘Muchengetei, pandinodzoka ndinodzoripa zvimwe zvese zvamunenge mashandisa.’”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />“Mbani pavatatu vakarevo, waunofunga, kuti ndiye adoratidza kuva mabiyake kumurume wokubatiwa nomakororo?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ridoti, “Nyakumunzvira tsitsi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Jesu adoti kwaari, “Endawo woita zvakarezvo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anobvakachira Marita naMariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Zvino pavanga vachienda, adopinda mumusha, mukadzi waiitiwa Marita adomutambira mumba mache. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Wanga ari mukoma nomunin'ina naMariya, nyakudzogara patsoka dzaIshe achitetekera zvaaidzidzisa. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Asi Marita anga achitadzisiwa nokutenaira kudonyanya, adoenda kwaari achiti, “Ishe, hamunei nazvo kuti mabiyangu wandisiya ndichitenaira ndega? Muudzei kuti andibatsirewo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Asi Ishe vadomupindura achiti, “Marita, Marita, unoshushikana nokuzvishupa nozvinhu zvidowanditsa, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />pano chinhu chibodzi chinodiwa, Mariya adosarura chikamu chidonaka, chaasingadzotorehwa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodzidzisa Kunamata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mateo 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Wanga achinamata pano imwe nzvimbo, paadopedza umwe wovadzidzi vache adoti kwaari, “Ishe tidzidziseiwo kunamata kunge zvidoitiwa naJohwani kuvadzidzi vache.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Zvino adoti kwavari, “Kana maakunamata namatai muchiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Baba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Zita renyu mbarikudziwe noutsvene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">umambo hwenyu mbahuuye.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Tipaseiwo zvokuja zvedu zvomazuva yese,<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />mutiregerere zvitadzo zvedu, nokuti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">isisu tinoregererawo vese vanotitadzira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Rekai kutipinza pakuedzewa.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Adodzoti kwavari, “Mbani pamuri angaite shamwari yaanovinga pakati pousiku achimuti, ‘Shamwari ndikweretesewo mazingwa matatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Ndava shamwari yangu iri pahwendo yasvika, apa handinai chokumubikira,’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Zvino iye angamupindure nai ari mukati achiti, Reka kundinetsa, ndavhara sasa, futi inini novana vangu tatoenzera. Handingamuke kamu ndichikupasa chinhu. <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Ndinokunyepa, kunyange asingamuke nondava yokuti ishamwari yache, asi nondava yokumbondomupenzverera asinganyare achamuka basi achimupasa zvese zvaanoda. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Saka ndinoti kwamuri, Kumbirai, muchapasiwa, tsvagai, muchawana, gugudzai, muchazururihwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Nokuti wese anokumbira anopiwa, noanotsvaga anowana, noanogugudza anozururihwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Mbapi baba pakati penyu, anoti kana mwanakomana wache akaruvira hove angamupase nyoka panzvimbo yohove, <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />kana akakumbira zai, angamupase karize? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Manje kana imipa vadoipa, muchiziva kupasa vana venyu zvidonaka, Baba vari kudenga vanokungudzirabafuti nai kupasa Mweya Mutsvene kuno avo vanovakumbira!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu naBherizebhuri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mateo 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mariko 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Zvino wanga achidzinga shave rouchimumumu, shave paridobirika chimumumu chidotaura, vanhu vadobva vashamisika. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Asi vamwe vadoti, “Anobiritsa mashave naBherizebhuri mukuru womashave.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Vamwewo vachimuedza, vadotsvaga chiratidzo chokudenga kubva kwaari. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Asi iye achiziva mifungo yavo, adoti kwavari, “Umambo hwese hunozvipesanisa hunowira pasi, noimba idopatsanurana inowa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Kana naiyewo sathani achizvipesanisa, umambo hwache huchamira tini? Nokuti muri kuti ndinodzinga mashave naBherizebhuri. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Kana inini ndichidzinga mashave naZerubhabhu, ko vanakomana venyu vanoyadzinga naani? Saka vanakomana venyu vachava vatongi venyu. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Asi kana ndichidzinga mashave noruoko raMwari, saka Umambo hwaMwari hwauya kwamuri.”<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Kana nyamasimba, adopakata zvombo zvese, achichengetedza muzinda wake, midziyo yake inenge idochengetedzeka, <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />asi pakaita anomukunda masimba womuhwisa achimukurira, anomutorera zvombo zvaanga achivimba nazvo, wokovera zvaapamba.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Asiri nainini anopesana nainini, noasingaunganidze pabodzi nainini anopamwadza.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudzoka Kwomweya Udoipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mateo 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Kana mweya udoipa wabirika mumunhu, unopinda nomunzvimbo dzisinai mvura uchitsvaga pokuthurira mafemo, ukapasaya unoti, ‘Ndichadzokera kumba kwangu kwandidobva.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Kana wadzoka unowana mumba muye matsvaihwa futi marongedzewa. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Unobva waenda kotora imwe mweya minomwe inoukunda kuipa, inopinda yogara makaremo, kupedzisira kwomunhu wakareyo kudoipitsa kukunda kuthanga kwache.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufaro Wochokwadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Paanga achitaura zvakarezvo, mukadzi anga ari mugurusvusvu adosumudza izvi rache achiti kwaari, “Idokomborehwa mimba idokuzvarai nomazamu yamudomwa!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Asi adoti, “Vadokomborehwa maninge mbaye vanonzva shoko raMwari nokurichengeta!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupopera Chishamiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mateo 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Apo gurusvusvu rovanhu paraiingidzika kuwanda, adothanga kunyaira achiti, “Vanhu vonguwa ino vadoipa, vanotsvaga chiratidzo, manje hapanai chiratidzo chavachapasiwa kusiya kwochiratidzo chaJona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Ndava fanike Jona adova chiratidzo kuvanhu voNinivhi, ndizvo zvichaita Mwanakomana woMunhu kuvanhu vonguwa ino. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Mambokadzi wokuchamhembe achasumuka pakutongwa achipasa mhosva vanhu vonguwa ino, nokuti adobva kumhera kwonyika kuti anzve uchenjeri hwaSoromoni, onai adokura kuna Soromoni ari pano. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Varume vokuNinivha vachasumuka pakutongewa vachipikisa vanhu vonguwa ino nokuvapasa mhosva, nokuti vadotendeuka pavadoparidzihwa naJona, zvino chinhu chikuru kukunda Jona chiri pano.”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiedza choMuviri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mateo 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Hapanai anobatidza mwenje achiuisa padohwanda kana pasi potsvanda, asi unoisiwa pachigadziko, kuti vanopinda vaone chiedza. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Ziso rako ndiro mwenje womuviri wako. Kana ziso rako ridonaka, muviri wako wese unenge udozara chiedza, asi kana risinai kunaka, muviri wako wese unenge udozara rima. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Saka chenjererai kuti chiedza chiri mamuri chireke kuva rima. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Kana muviri wako wese udozara chiedza, pasinai panorima, unenge udovheneka wese, kunge zvinoitiwa nomwenje uchikupasa chiedza pakuvhenekera kwawene.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anopasa Mhosva vaFarisi novaDzidzisi voMutemo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mariko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Achiri kunyaira daipo, umwe muFarisi adomukumbira kuti aje naye, saka adoenda ndokutsveyama pathafura. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />MuFarisi adokanuka kuona kuti haanai kuthanga washamba. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Ishe adoti kwaari, “Manje imimi vaFarisi munosuka kunze kwokomichi nombenge, asi mukati menyu mudozara nonhafu nokuipa. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Imipa madzemwa! Handiti adoita kunze ndiye mubodziyo adoitawo mukati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Asi perekai zviri mukati, muchaona kuti zvese zvidochena kwamuri.”<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Manje mayanga kwamuri imimi vaFarisi! nokuti munopereka chogumi chomindi, noruwu nomiriwo yese, muchisiya kururamisira norudo raMwari izvozvi maifanira kuzviita, musingaregeri zvimwe zvacho.”<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Mayanga kwamuri imimi vaFarisi! Ndava munofarira mipando yopamusoro mumasinagoge nokumoresewa pamisika. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Mayanga kwamuri! ndava munenge makuwa yasingaoneki, zvokuti vanhu vanotekaira payari vasingazvizive.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Rimwe romagweta ridomupindura richiti, “Mudzidzisi, pakunyaira zvakarezvi muri kutoshorawo naisisu.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Iye adoti, “Mayanga kwamuriwo magweta! munotakudza vanhu mitoro inorema kutakura, asi imimi hamugwami mitoro yakareyo kana nokakumo kabodzi chaiko. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Mayanga kwamuri! nokuti munovakhirira makuwa yovaporofiti vadobaiwa nomadzibaba yenyu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Saka muri pfakazi dzinobvumirana nozvidoitiwa nomadzibaba yenyu, ndava ivo vadovabaya, imimi munovakhira makuwa yavo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Sakawo uchenjeri hwaMwari hudoti, ‘Ndichavatumira vaporofiti nonhumwa, vamwe vachavabaya, vamwe vachavatambudza,’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />kuti gazi rovaporofiti vese, ridodeuhwa kubva pamavambo yonyika ribvunziwe pavanhu vakareva. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />kubva pagazi raEbhero kusvika pagazi raZakariya, adobaihwa pakati poTafura yokupira zvipo noimba yaMwari. Inde, ndinokunyepai kuti richabvunziwa pamusoro povanhu vakareva.”<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Mayanga kwamuri imimi magweta! nokuti mudobiritsa khiyi yokupinda kuruzivo, imipa pachenyu hamunai kupinda, mudotadzisa vaye vanga vachipinda.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Paanga waakubva pakarepo, vaNyori novaFarisi vadothanga kumupikisa zvidonyanya, vachimusora kuti ataure zvinhu zvidowanda, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />vadomuteya kuti vawane pavangamubate napo pakunyaira.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Kutsindikihwa Pamusoro poKunyengera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mateo 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Pazvanga zvichidaro, gurusvusvu rikuru rozviuru ridoungana zvokutoti vaitsikirirana, adothanga nokunyairira vadzidzi vache kuti, “Chenjererai mbiriso yovaFarisi, hunova unyengeri. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Asi hapanai chidofukidziwa chisingadzobiritsiwa pachenu, kana chidosvisviwa chisingadzozikana. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Saka chese chamudonyaira murima chichanzvika pachiedza, nochamudonyaira kazevezeve mudzimba dzomukati chichaparidziwa pamusoro podzimba.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anofanira Kuchiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mateo 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ndinokunyepai shamwari dzangu, rekai kucha vanobaya muviri, vasinai chavanogona kuita mumasure mozvakarezvo. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Asi ndichakunyepai wamunofanira kucha, ichai iye anoti kana muviri wako wapfa, anomasimba yokukukhandira muGehena, inde, ndinokunyepai, muchei wakareyo!”<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Ko tusudzamvura tushano tunotengesewaba nomapeni mairi? Asi hapanai kana kabodzi chaiko kanokangamwiwa naMwari. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Asi, kana novhudzi romusoro wenyu ridotoverengewa peno. Rekai kucha, ndava mudokosha kukunda tusudzamvura tuzinji.”<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupupura Nokuramba Khirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32">Mateo 10:32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:2">12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19">10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Ndinokunyepai futi, kuti wese anondibvuma pamberi povanhu, Mwanakomana woMunhu achamubvumawo pamberi pongirozi dzaMwari, <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />asi anondiramba pamberi povanhu acharambiwawo pamberi pongirozi dzaMwari. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Nowese anotaura shoko rinopesana noMwanakomana womunhu anoregerehwa, asi anoshora Mweya Mutsvene anoregerehwaba.”<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Kana maendesewa pamberi pomasinagoge nopovatongi novanomasimba, rekai kunetseka kuti muchapindurei kana kuti muchati chii. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Nokuti Mweya Mutsvene achakudzidzisai panguwa yakareyo zvamunofanira kutaura.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo Womupfumi Dzemwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Umwe mukati mogurusvusvu adoti kwaari, “Tenzi, rairai mukoma wangu kuti akoverane nainini nhaka.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Asi adoti kwaari, “Iwe munhu, mbani adondiita mutongi kana mukovanisi pakati penyu?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Manje adoti kwavari, “Hokoyo, futi muchenjerere kuchiva kwese, ndava upenyu hwomunhu hahusi pazvinhu zvizinji zvaanazvo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Adovanyepa mufananidzo achiti, “Munda womumwe mupfumi udoita gohwo ridokuritsa, <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Adofunga mumwoyo, achiti, ‘Chii chandichaita, ndava handinai pokuchengetera zvirimwa zvangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Ipopo adoti, ‘izvi ndizvo zvandichaita, Ndichapwanya zvitura zvangu, ndovakha zvikuru. Makaremo ndimo mandichaisa zvirimwa zvangu zvese nomidziyo yangu. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ipopo ndichati kumweya wangu, unozvinhu zvizinji zvidochengetehwa makore mazinji. Tambarara, ija, umwe, ufare.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Asi Mwari adoti kwaari, ‘Iwe dzemwa! Usiku huno mweya wako uchatohwa, ko zvinhu zvawagadzira zvichava zvaani?’”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />“Zvakarezvo ndozvidoita munhu anozviunganidzira pfuma, asi asinai kupfuma kuna Mwari.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vimba naMwari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mateo 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ipopo adoti kuvadzidzi vache, “Saka ndinokunyepai kuti mureke kushushikana pamusoro poupenyu hwenyu chamuchaja kana pamusoro pomuviri wenyu chamuchasimira. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ndava upenyu hunokunda chokuja, nomuviri unokunda chokusimira. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Cherechedzai makunguwo, kuti hayajari kana kukohwa, hayanai pokuchengetera kana chitura, asi zvidodaipo Mwari anoyaposha! Handiti imimi mudotokoshetsa kukunda tushiri! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Futi mbani pakati penyu angaingidzire khubiti ribodzi rokurepha kwache nokushushikana? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Manje kana muchitadza kuita chinhu chidiki kunge ichocho, munonetsekerei pamusoro pozvimwe zvese? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Cherechedzai maruva, kuti yanokura tini, hayashandi kana kurukha, asi zvidodaipo ndinokunyepai kuti kana naiye Soromoni pakubhwinya kwache kwese haanai kupfekedzewa zvidofanana norimwe royakareya. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Zvino kana Mwari achipfekedza zvidodai usva hwomusango, hunondovapo nasi huchidzokhandiwa mumoto hwedza, angareke nai kunyanya kukupfekedzai vakaremi? Vanhu vokutenda kudiki!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Saka rekai kutsvaga chamuchaja kana chamuchamwa, kana kushushikana mupfungwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ndava marudzi yese yonyika vanotsvaga zvinhu zvakarezvi, asi Baba venyu vanoziva kuti munozvida. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Asi tsvagai umambo hwache, zvinhu zvakarezvi zvichava zvenyu pakamu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfuma Yokudenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mateo 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Rekai kucha, kapoka kadiki, ndava Baba venyu vadofadziwa kukupasai Umambo. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Tengesai zvamunazvo mupereke zvipo. Zvinhadzirirei zvikwama zvisingasakare, zvinoupfumi kudenga husingapfuruke, kusingasvikiwe nombavha kana tukumo hatuiparadzi. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ndava panopfuma yako pakarepo ndipo panomwoyo wako.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Varanda Vanogaririra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Zviuno zvenyu mbazvisungiwe nomwenje yenyu mbaipfute, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />itai kunge vanhu vadogaririra tenzi wavo, paachadzoka achibva kumabiko yomuchato, kuti paanouya achigugudza, vanomuzururira nokamangu. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Vadokomborehwa varanda vanowaniwa vadopenya paanouya tenzi, ndinokunyepai chokwadi chokuti, tenzi achazvipira kuvagarisa pasi, iye wovatenairira kuti vaje. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Kana akauya panguwa yochipiri, kana yochitatu, wovawana vadodaro, vadokomborehwa varanda vakarevo! <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Asi zivai zvakarezvi, kuti dai mwenekachiro woimba waiziva nguwa inouya mbavha, waidzogaririra woreka kurekera imba yache ichipaziwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Naimipawo gadzirirai, ndava Mwanakomana womunhu achauya nonguwa yamusingamufungire.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muranda Adotendeka kana Asinai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mateo 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Pita adoti, “Ishe, anga mufananidzo wakareyu maunyairira isisu chere, kana kuti vanhu vese?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Ishe adoti, “Mbani manje mutariri adotendeka futi adochenjera, angaitiwe mutungamiri woimba yatenzi wache, kuti avapase zvokuja zvavo panguwa idofanira? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Muranda wakareyo adokomborehwa, anowaniwa achiita zvakarezvo panouya tenzi wake. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />ndinokunyepai chokwadi, kuti achamugadza kuti ave mukuru wozvese zvaanazvo. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Asi kana muranda wakareyo akati mumwoyo mache, ‘Tenzi wangu wachehwa kuuya,’ wothanga kurova varandarume novarandakadzi, achija nokumwa nokuredzera, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />tenzi womuranda wakareyo achauya nozuva raasingamutarisire noawa yaasingazive, achamugwata nokumuisa pabodzi novasingatende. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Muranda anoziva zvinodiwa natenzi wache, akareka kuzvigadzirira kuita kana kuzvipira kuita zvinodiwazvo, acharohwa zvidokungudza, <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Asi uyo asingazive, akaita zvinorovesa, acharohwa zvishoma. Nokunowese adopasiwa zvidowanda, kwaari kuchabvunziwa zvidowandawo, nokunoadopasiwa zvidowanda, achabvunziwawo zvidowanda.”<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mukonzeri woKupesana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mateo 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Ndidouya kokhanda moto panyika, ndinototi dai udobatidziwa kare! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Asi ndinoruombeko randichaombekewa naro, futi ndiri kumanikidzika zvidonyanya kusvikira raitika! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Munofunga kuti ndidouya kopasa runyararo panyika nai? Ndinokunyepai kuti, neye, asi kudzopesanisa. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Nokuti kubva ipopa mumba munovanhu vashano, muchava nokupesana. Vatatu vachapesana novairi, novairi vachapesana novatatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Kuchava nokupesana kwababa nomwanakomana, nomwanakomana nababa. Amai vachapesana nomwanasikana, nomwanasikana achapesana namaache. Amwene vachapesana nomuroora, nomuroora achapesana naamwene vache.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunzvitsitsa Nguwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mateo 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Adonyepa gurusvusvu pakare achiti, “Pamunoona guti richikwira kumadokero, nokamangu munoti, ‘Kuchana.’ Zvotoitika daipo. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Futi pamunoona mhepo yokuchamhembe ichivhuvhuta munoti, ‘Kuchapisitsa.’ Zvakarezvo zvotoitika. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Imi vanyengeri! Munoziva kududzira mamiriro yopasi nokudzuru, asi munotadza tini kududzira mamiriro yonguwa ino?”<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gadzirisana Nowaunopikisana Naye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mateo 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Sei imipa pachenyu musingatongane zvidonaka? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Paunenge uchienda nomunenedzeri wako pamberi pomutongi, wirirana naye muchiri munzira, kuti areke kudzokupereka kumutongi, nomutongi wodzokupereka kumupurisa, nomupurisa achidzokuvharira mutorongo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ndinokunyepai, unomubirikaba, kusvikira waripa kamari kokupedzisira.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Pindukai Kubva Muzvitema Zvenyu Kana Kupfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Manje panguwa yakareyo padoita vamwe vanga varipo vadomunyepa kuti Pirato adosanganisa magazi yovaGaririya nozvipiriso zvavo. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Iye adovapindura ndokuti kwavari, “Ko munofunga kuti vaGaririya vova vanga vadonyanyitsa kuipa kukunda vaGaririya vese nai, nokuti vadotambudzika zvidodaro? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ndinokuudzai, Neye, asi imimi kunze kwokutoti mapinduka muchaparadziwawo daro. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Kana vaye gumi novasere, vadowihwa nochirindo chomuSiromu vachibva vapfa, munofunga kuti vanga vadoipa kukunda vagari vese vomuJerusarema nai? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ndinokuudzai, Neye, asi kana musingapinduki muchaparadziwawo daro.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woMukuyu Usingabereke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Adotaura kamu mufananidzo uyu, “Umwe murume wanga anomukuyu udojariwa mudimba rache romizambiringa, adouya kotsvaga muchero pauri ndokusaya. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Adobva wati kumuchengetedzi womuzambiringa, ‘Onaka, makore matatu aya ndaimbondouya ndichitsvaga muchero pamukuyu wakareyu, ndichisaya. Ugwate, nokuti unochenekereiko pasi?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Adomupindura achiti, ‘Changamire, uregei zvawene gore rino, kusvikira ndautimbira nokuuisa mupfudze. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Kana ukadzoita muchero gore rinouya, zvidonaka, asi kana ukadzotadzawo, munougwata.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Mukadzi Adopfa Muthezo noSabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Zvino waidzidzisa munorimwe sinagoge paSabata. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Panga pano mukadzi wanga anomweya wohodza kwomakore gumi nomasere, wanga adotumbamisiwa nawo asingagone kuzvitwasura. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Jesu paadomuona adomudaidza ndokuti kwaari, “Mukadzi, wasununguhwa pahodza yako.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Adobva waisa manja pamusoro pache, nokamangu adotwasanuka, ndokubva warumbidza Mwari. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Asi mukuru wosinagoge adokaripa nokuti Jesu wanga waporesa noSabata, ndokuti kuvanhu, “Panomazuva matanhatu yanoitiwa nayo basa, uyai pamazuva yakareyo muporesewe, asi aikona nozuva roSabata.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Ipopo Ishe vadomupindura, “Imi vanyengeri! Handiti umwe noumwe wenyu anosugudura dhonza kana buru rache kubva mubara paSabata, achienda koripasa mvura chere? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Saka mukadzi uyu, mwanasikana waAbhurahamu, wanga adosungiwa naSathani, kwomakore gumi nomasere, woreka chere kusununguhwa nokuti musi woSabata?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Paadonyaira zvakarezvi, vavengi vache vese vadonyara, vanhu vese vadokondwa nozvinhu zvese zvinoshamisa zvaadoita.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo Wombeu yoMasitadhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mateo 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mariko 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Saka adoti, “Umambo hwaMwari hudofanana nei? Ndingahuenzanise nochii? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Hudofanana nombeu yomasitadhi inotohwa nomunhu achiijara mudimba mache, idokura ukava muti, uye tushiri tomudenga tudoita usanza mumathai yawene.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo Wombiriso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mateo 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Adotaura pakare achiti, “Umambo hwaMwari ndingahuenzanise nei? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Hudofanana nombiriso idotohwa nomukadzi achiisa mumhimo dzitatu dzoupfu hwogorosi, kusvikira zvese zvavira.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musuwo Udosvisvidika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mateo 7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">7:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Adofamba hwendo hwache nomumaguta nomumisha achidzidzisa, achienda adonanga kuJerusarema. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Umwe adomubvunza achiti, “Nai Ishe, vachaponesewa mbashoma chere?” Iye adoti kwavari, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Patikidzai kupinda nopamusuwo udosvanika, ndava ndinokunyepai kuti vazinji, vachatsvaga kupinda asi vachakonaba. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Kana mwenekachiro woimba wasumuka kuzarira sasa, imipa muchathanga kumira panze muchigugudza pamusuwo muchiti, ‘Ishe, tizururireiwo.’ Achakupindurai achiti, ‘Handizivi kwamunobva.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Ipopo muchathanga kuti, ‘Tidoja nokumwa naimimi, futi mudodzidzisa mumigwagwa yedu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Asi iye achati, ‘Ndinokunyepai kuti handizive kwamunobva. Birikai pano mese, vakaremi vaiti vozvidoipa!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Pakarepo mucharira nokugedageda meno yenyu, pamuchaona Abhurahamu, naIsaki, naJakobho novaporofiti vese muumambo hwaMwari imimi muchikutukudzihwa panze. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />vanhu vachauya kubva kumabvazuva nokumadokero, nokumaodzanyemba nokuchamhembe, vachidzogara patafura muumambo hwaMwari. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Uye, vamwe vari vokupedzisira ndivo vachava vokuthanga, novokuthanga vachazova vokupedzisira.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rudo raJesu pamusoro poJerusarema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mateo 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Panguwa yakareyo vamwe vaFarisi vadouya vachiti kwaari, “Birika pano, nokuti Herudhe ari kuda kukubaya.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Endai koudza gava rakareriye kuti, ‘Ona ndiri kudzinga mashave nokurapa nasi nomangwana, nomungwani ndipo pandichapedza ndima yangu. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Zvisinei ndinofanira kufamba nasi, mangwana nomungwani, nokuti zvingaitikeba kuti muporofiti apararire kunze kwoJerusarema.’<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Jerusarema, Jerusarema, unobaya vaporofiti nokutema nomabhwe vaye vanotumiwa kwauri! Kazinji maninge ndichida kuunganidza vana vako, kunge huku inohwamira tutiyo twayene mumaphaphiro asi unoramba! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Ona, imba yako yasiiwa yaparara. Ndinokunyepai futi kuti muchandionaba, kusvikira pamuchadzoti, ‘Adokomborehwa iye anouya muzita raIshe.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Murume Waihwara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Paadoenda kumba kwoumwe wovatungamiri, muFarisi koja uri musi wosabata, zvidoitika kuti vadomunangaritsa. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Pakarepo panga pano umwe murume wanga adozvimba. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Jesu adotaura kumagweta novaFarisi achiti, “Zviri pamutemo chere, kuporesa noSabata kana kurega?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Asi ivo vadoramba vadonyarara. Pakarepo adomutora ndokumuporesa, nokumureka achienda. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Mbani wenyu ano buru kana dhonza kana rikawira musime, angareke nai kuribiritsirafuti nokamangu nondava yokuti isabata?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ivo havanai kumupindura pakamu panozvakarezvi.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzvidikipisa Nokutambira Varendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Zvino adotaura mufananidzo kuno vaye vanga vakokewa, paadoona vachibangira nzvimbo dzovanoremekedzewa, adoti kwavari, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Kana wakokewa nomunhu kumuchato, rega kugara pamupando wovakuru, pamwe pano umwe anokukunda kuremekedzewa adokokewawo, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />kuti iye adokukokai mese akadzouya achiti kwauri, Iwe pasa nzvimbo uyu, pakarepo uchathanga kunyara paunotora nzvimbo yopasi pasi. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Asi kana wakokewa, enda kogara pamupando unoshoreka, kuitira kuti kana adokukoka wauya adzoti kwauri, ‘Shamwari, enda kumusoro padokwirira,’ ipopo ucharemekedzewa pamberi povese vaudogara navo pathafura. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Nokuti wese anozvikudza achaninipisiwa, nouyo anozvininipisa achakwiridzihwa.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Adoti pakare kumunhu adomukoka, “Kana waita mabiko kana mutambo, reka kukoka shamwari kana hama dzako kana vavakhidzani vadopfuma, kuti vareke kudzokukokawo, vachikwichidza zvaudovaitira. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Asi kana waakuita mabiko, koka varombo, novadokuwara, novadoremara, novasingaone, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />ipopo uchakomborehwa, ndava havakoni kukukwichidza. Uchakwichidziwa pakumuka kwovadorurama.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo Womabiko Makuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mateo 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Zvino umwe wanga adogarikika naye patafura paadonzva zvakarezvi, adoti kwaari, “Adokomborehwa nguyo achaja mazingwa muUmambo hwaMwari!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Asi adoti kwaari, “Umwe murume adoita mabiko makuru, ndokukoka vazinji, <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Adotuma muranda wache panguwa yomutambo kodaidza vadokokewa, ‘Uyai, nokuti zvinhu zvese zvagadzihwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Asi vese pabodzi vadothanga kupa zvikonzero. Wokuthanga adoti kwaari, Ndidotenga munda, saka ndinofanira kuenda kouona, ndinourombo ndichauyaba. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Umwe adoti, ‘Ndatenga zvipani zvishano zvomadhonza, saka ndiri kuenda koyaedza, ndinourombo ndichauyaba.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Umwe kamu adoti, ‘Ndaroora mukadzi, saka ndichauyaba.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Saka muranda adouya ndokuudza tenzi wache zvakarezvo. Pakarepo noukari mwenekachiro woimba adoti kumuranda wache, ‘Enda nokamangu munzira nomumigwagwa yoguta, uuye novarombo novadokuvara novasingaone novadoremara.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ipopo muranda adoti, ‘Tenzi, zvamaraira zvaitiwa, asi nzvimbo ichiripo.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Zvino tenzi adoti kumuranda wache, ‘Enda mumigwagwa nomunzira dzomumisha, usukumidzire vanhu vapinde, kuti imba yangu izare. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Ndava ndinokunyepai kuti, hapanai nomubodzi zvache wovadokokewa achananzva mabiko yangu.’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zvinokonzehwa Nokuva Mudzidzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mateo 10:37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:38">38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Zvino mhomho ikuru idoenda naye, iye adochununguka ndokuti kwavari, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Kana pano anouya kwandiri asingazonde baba vache namaache, nomukadzi novana, novakoma novanin'ina nohanzvadzi, asingazvizondewo iye pachake angaveba mudzidzi wangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Wese asingatakure muchinjikwa wache achinditevera, haangave mudzidzi wangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Mbatiti pakati penyu pano anoda kuvakha chirindo, haangareke kuthanga wagara pasi achiverenga mutengo wachene, kuti aone kana anomari inokwana kusvika pakupedzisa kuvakha chirindocho. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ndava kana akathanga kuvakha nheyo, wodzotadza kupedzisa, vese vanoiona vanothanga kumunyadza, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />vachiti, ‘Munhu uyu adothanga kuvakha, manje watadzirira kupedzisa.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Kana kuti ngupi mambo angamisidzane noumwe mambo muhondo, asingathange wagara pasi kuti aone kana achikona nozviuru zvache gumi zvomauto, kuhwisana noumwe mambo anomauto makumi mairi yozviuru? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Kuti kana asingakone, atumire nhume kuno umwe wacho achiri kurefu achikumbira runyararo. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Saka naizvozvo, wese pakati penyu asingarambe zvese zvaanazvo haangave mudzidzi wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwinyu Usingabatsire</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mateo 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mariko 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Mwinyu udonaka, asi kana wataya kuvava kwawene, hapanai madzotsero yangaitiwe kuvava kwawene. <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Hauchinai kabonyo kuivhu kana kumuhwi womupfudze, vanhu vanoutaya. Anonzeve mbaatetekere anzve!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Hwai Ridotaika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mateo 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Manje vateresi novatadzi vese vadonyedza kuna Jesu kuti vamunzve. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />VaFarisi novanyori vadon'un'uzika vachiti, “Murume uyu anotambira vatadzi, achija navo.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Jesu adobva wavanyepa mufananidzo.<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />Adoti. “Mbani pakati penyu kana anozana romahwai, anoti kana ribodzi rataika angareke kusiya makumi mapfemba nomapfemba musango, woenda koritsvaga kusvikira wariwana? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Kana wariwana anoriisa, papfudzi pache achifara. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Paanosvika kumba anokokera shamwari dzache novavakhidzani, achiti kwavari, ‘Farai nainini, nokuti ndawana hwai rangu ranga rataika.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Nokudaro ndinokuudzai kuti kudenga kunenge kuno mufaro mukuru pamusoro pomutadzi mubodzi anotendeuka, kukunda vanhu makumi mapfemba novapfemba vadorurama vasingade kupinduka.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woMari Idotaika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Pangave nomukadzi chere anoti kana, ano masirivha gumi, akataya sirivha ribodzi angareke kubatidza mwenje kuti avheneke, wotsvaira mumba mese kusvikira wariwana? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Kana wariwana anounganidza shamwari dzache novavakhidzani achiti, ‘Farai nainini, nokuti ndawana sirivha randanga ndataya.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Saka ndinotiwo kwamuri, pamberi pongirozi dzaMwari panomufaro kana mutadzi mubodzi watendeuka.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanakomana Adotaika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Iye adoti, “Panga pano murume anga ano vana vakomana vairi. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Mudiki wacho adoti kuna baba vache, ‘Baba, ndipasei chikamu chopfuma yangu yonhaka.’ Baba vadokovanisa pfuma yavo pakati pavo. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Pasinai nonhambwe yese, mwanakomana mudiki adounganidza pfuma yache yese ndokuenda kuimwe nyika kurefurefu. Adocheneka pfuma yese nomagariro yadoipa. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Paadopedza kuja pfuma yakareyo yese, nzara idokungudza idovapo kunyika yakareyo, iye adosara asinai chinhu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Nokudaro adoenda kogarawo nonzvahwa yomunyika yakareyo, adodzomutuma kumaminda yache kochengeta humba. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Wanga achitoda kugutsiwa nochikafu chomashanga yaijiwa nohumba, pasinai waimupasa. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Asi paadozopengenuka adoti, ‘Vashandi vababa vangu vangani vanotoja vachisiya zvimwe, asi pano ini ndaakutopfa nonzara! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ndichasumuka ndiende kuna baba vangu, futi ndoti, Baba, ndidotadzira denga, nopamberi penyu, <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ndichakodzeraba kuitiwa mwanakomana wenyu, ndibatei kunge umwe wovashandi venyu.’” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Adosumuka ndokuenda kuna baba vache. Asi baba vache pavadomuona achiri kurefu, vadomunzvira mutsa, ndokumhanyira komuzvembetera nokumutsvoda.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />“Mwanakomana adobva wati kwavari, ‘Baba, ndidotadzira denga, nopamberi penyu, ndichakodzeraba kuitiwa mwanakomana wenyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Asi baba vadoti kuvashandi vavo, ‘Uyai kamangu nohembe idonakitsa, mupfekedzei, moisa ringi pakakumo kache, noshangu patsoka dzache. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Muuye nochimhuru chidokora mubaye tije, tifare. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Nokuti mwanakomana wanguyu wanga wapfa, asi waamupuma pakamu, wanga wataika, asi wawanika.’ Vadothanga kufara.”<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Zvino mukoma wache anga ari kumunda, paadosvika papfupi nopamumba, adonzva kuimba nokutamba. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Iye adodaidza umwe wovashandi ndokumubvunza kuti chii changa chichiitika. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Iye adoti kwaari, ‘Munin'ina wako wauya, saka baba vako vamubaira chimhuru chidokora, nokuti vamuona achiri mupenyu, futi adosimba.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Asi iye adokaripa nazvo, ndokuramba kupinda mukati. Baba vache vadobirika panze ndokumupenzverera. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Asi adopindura baba vache achiti, ‘Onai, makore aya yese ndidokushandirai, handinai kureka kuteerera kuraira kwenyu, asi hamunai kundipasa kana kashere chaiko kuti ndije ndichifara noshamwari dzangu! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Asi paandodzoka wakareyu mwanakomana wenyu, wokupedzera upfumi hwenyu kupfambi, mamubaira chimhuru chidokora.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Baba vache vadoti kwaari, ‘Mwanakomana, iwewe uneni nguwa dzese futi zvese zvangu nzvako. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Zvagara zvidokodzera kupembera nokufara, nokuti munin'ina wako uyu wanga wapfa, apa wararama. Wanga wataika asi wawanika.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Mutariri Wopfuma Adochenjera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Adotiwo kuvadzidzi vache, “Paiva nomupfumi wanga ano mutariri wopfuma, zvipomehwa zvidoisiwa kwaari zvokuti munhu wache anga achimuparadzira zvinhu. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Saka adomudaidza ndokuti kwaari, ‘Chii ichi chandiri kunzva pamusoro pako? Nditsanangurire mabatiro yauri kuita utariri hwako, nokuti ungaenderereba mberi uri mutariri.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Mutariri adoti mumwoyo mache, ‘Ndichaita tini, sezvo tenzi wangu waakunditorera utariri hwangu? Kuti nditimbe ndidovhuwa, futi kuruvira ndinonyara. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ndaziva zvandichaita, kuti vanhu vanditambire mudzimba dzavo kana ndabiritsiwa pautariri.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Saka adodaidza mubodzi mubodzi pavanhu vanga vano zvikwerete naTenzi wavo, adoti kuno wokuthanga, ‘Nzvingani zvaudokwereta kuna tenzi wangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Adoti, ‘Zviyero zana zvomafuta yomuOrivhi.’ Adoti kwaari, ‘Tora pokunyorera ugarikike pasi nokamangu unyore makumi mashano.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Zvino adodzoti kuno umwe, ‘Ko iwewe nzvingani zvaudokwereta?’ Iye adoti, ‘Zviyero zana zvogorosi.’ Adoti kwaari, ‘Tora pokunyorera, unyore makumi masere.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Tenzi adopembedza mutariri asinai kutendeka nokuda kwouchenjeri hwache, nokuti vanakomana vonyika ino vadochenjera pamashandiro yavo novanhu vonguwa dzavo kukunda vanakomana vochiedza.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />“Zvino ndinokunyepai, zviitirei shamwari kuburikidza nopfuma isinai kururama, kuitira kuti painokundikana vakutambirei muugaro hwokusingapere. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Uyo adotendeka pazvishoma adotendekawo pazvizinji, nouyo asinai kutendeka pazvishoma haanai kutendekawo pazvizinji. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Manje kana manga musinai kutendeka papfuma isinai kururama, mbani angavimbe naimimi kukupasai pfuma yochokwadi? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Kana manga musinai kutendeka pazvinhu zvoumwe, mbani achakupasai zvenyu?”<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Hapanai mushandi angashandire anatenzi vairi, nokuti anodzovenga mubodzi achida umwe, kana kudzozvipira kunomubodzi achinyozera umwe. Hamungashandire Mwari nomari.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zvimwe Zvidotauhwa naJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mateo 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mariko 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Zvino vaFarisi vokuditsa mari, pavadonzva zvakarezvo zvese, vadomushora. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Asi iye adobva wati kwavari, “Ndimi vaye vanozviita vadorurama pamberi povanhu, asi Mwari anoziva mwoyo yenyu. Nokuti zvinosumudzihwa novanhu, zvidonyangara pamberi paMwari.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Mutemo novaporofiti zvidovapo kusvikira pana Johwani, kubva pakarepo Nyaya Idonaka youmambo hwaMwari iri kuparidziwa. Apa wese munhu ari kupinda mahuri nochisimba. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Asi zvidotopusa kuti denga nonyika zvipfuruke, panokuti kabhii kabodzi komutemo kasaye basa.”<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Wese anoramba mukadzi wache achiroora umwe anoita upombwe, naiyewo anoroora mukadzi adorambiwa nomurume wache anoita upombwe.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murume Mupfumi NaRazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Kwanga kuno umwe murume wanga adopfuma, waipfeka nguwo dzitsvuku dzidonaka nokuja zvidonaka mazuva yese. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Pasuwo pache paigara murume murombo waiitiwa Razaro, wanga adozara zvironda, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />waida kuposhewa nozvaimbwera kubva pathafura yomupfumi, noimbwawo dzaiuya dzichinanzva zvironda zvache. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Murombo adopfa ndokutakuhwa nongirozi dzichimuisa pachipfuwa chaAbhurahamu. Mupfumi adodzopfawo ndokuvigiwa, <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />ari muHadhesi, achiyaura, adosumudza meso yache, ndokuona Abhurahamu ari kurefu naRazaro ari pachipfuwa chache. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Adodaidzira, ‘Baba Abhurahamu, ndinzvirei tsitsi, tumai Razaro anyike kumhera kwokakumo kache mumvura atonhodze chirimi changu, ndava ndiri kudzimbiwa murimi rino romoto.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Asi Abhurahamu adoti, ‘Mwanakomana, yeuka kuti panguwa youpenyu hwako udotambira zvidonaka zvako, zvidodaro Razaro adotambira zvidoipa, asi zvino ari kunyaradziwa pano, iwepa uri mundondo. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Pamusoro pozvakarezvo zvese, pakati pedu naimimi padoisiwa gomba ridonoketsa, kuitira kuti vaye vanoda kubva kuno vachiuya kwakareko vatadzirire, uyewo kuti pasaye vangayambukire kuno vachibva kwakareko.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Zvino adoti, ‘Saka ndinokukumbirai baba, kuti mumutume kumba kwababa vangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />ndava ndino vanin'ina vashano, kuti avachenjedze, kuti vareke kudzouyawo munzvimbo ino yokuyaura.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Asi Abhurahamu adoti, ‘Mozisi novaporofiti vanavo, mbavavanzve vakarevo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Asi adoti, ‘Neye, baba Abhurahamu, asi kana pakaita anoenda kwavari achibva kuvadopfa, vachapinduka.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Adoti kwaari, ‘Kana vasinganzvi Mozisi novaporofiti, vanopindukarini kana pakatomuka umwe kubva kuvadopfa.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Chitadzo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mateo 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21">21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mariko 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Futi adoti kuvadzidzi vache, “Miedzo yokuti munhu atadze inouya pachokwadi, asi mayanga kuno uyo anouya nayo! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Zvaitova hasa kwaari kana guyo raisungirihwa mumutsipa wache achichudumutsiwa mugungwa, panokukonzera umwe wovadiki vakareva kutadza. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Zvichenjererei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Kana hama yenyu yatadza, mudzumei, kana akapinduka, muregererei, <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />kana akakutadzirai kanomwe pazuva ribodzi, achidzoka kwamuri kanomwe, achiti, ‘Ndatendeuka,’ munofanira kumuregerera.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Nhumwa vadoti kuna Ishe, “Ingidzirai kutenda kwedu!”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Ishe vadoti, “Dai muno kutenda kunenge mbeu yomasitadhi, maigona kuti kumuti uyu womukuyu, ‘Dzupuka udzikiwe munyanza,’ waikuteererai.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basa Romushandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Aripo chere pakati penyu, anomushandi wobasa rokugaura nokurisa mahwai paanenge wabva kumunda angamuti, ‘Chiuya izvozvi ugarikike uje pathafura?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Handiti anotomuti, ‘Tenaira undiitire chirairo, ndije nokumwa. Mumasure mozvakarezvo wodzojawo nokumwa?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Anotenda mushandi chere nondava yokuti waita zvaadoraihwa? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Naimimiwo, kana maita zvese zvamudoraihwa, moti, ‘Tiri varanda vasingakoshe, tandoita zvataifanira kuita.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Varume Gumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Paanga achienda kuJerusarema, adopinda nopakati poSamariya noGaririya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Achipinda mumusha, adosangana novanhu gumi vanga vanomabobo, ivo vadomira kurefu, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />ndokusumudza mazvi yavo vachiti, “Jesu, Tenzi, tinzvirei tsitsi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Paadovaona adoti kwavari, “Endai kozvinangidza kuvapirisita.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Pavanga vachienda vadobva vapora. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Zvino mabiyavo, paadondoona kuti waporesewa, adodzoka, achirumbidza Mwari noizvi riri pamusoro, <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Adowira pasi nochiso potsoka dzaJesu, achimutenda. Zvino iyeyo wanga ari muSamariya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Ipopo Jesu adoti, “Anga vaporesewa vanga vasiri gumi nai? Ko vapfemba vari poi? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Hapanai chere wadzoka kuti auye korumbidza Mwari kusiya kwaiyeyu mutohwa?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Adoti kwaari, “Sumuka uende zvako, kutenda kwako kwakuporesa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kwoUmambo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mateo 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Achibvunziwa novaFarisi kuti Umambo hwaMwari hwaidzouya rini, adovapindura, “Umambo hwaMwari hahuuye nozviratidzo zvinooneka, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />havangati, ‘Onai, huri pano!’ kana kuti, ‘Huri uko!’ ndava nangarai, Umambo hwaMwari huri pakati penyu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Manje adoti kuvadzidzi, “Mazuva yari kuuya pamuchasuva kuona rimwe romazuva yoMwanakomana woMunhu, asi munorionaba. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Zvino vachati kwamuri, ‘Nangarai, uko!’ kana kuti, ‘Nangarai kuno!’ Rekai kuenda, rekai kuvatevera. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Nokuti semapenyero yanoita mheni ichivheneka denga kubva kurimwe divi kuenda kuno rimwe, ndizvo zvichaita Mwanakomana woMunhu pazuva rache. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Asi anofanira kutambudziwa pazvinhu zvizinji nokurambiwa novanhu vonguwa ino. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Sezvazvanga zvidoita pamazuva yaNowa, ndizvo zvazvichaitawo pamazuva yoMwanakomana woMunhu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Vaija, vaimwa, vairoorana kusvikira zuva Nowa raadopinda mungarava mvura idouya ichivaparadza vese. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Ndizvo kamu zvazvanga zvidoita mumazuva yaRoti, vaija, vaimwa, vaitenga, vaitengesa, vaijara, vaivakha, <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />asi pazuva ridobirika Roti muSodhoma moto nochefu yoruvara rokheri zvidona kubva kudenga zvichivaparadza vese, <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />ndizvo zvazvichaitawo pazuva richaratidziwa Mwanakomana woMunhu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Pazuva rakarero, uyo anenge ari pamusoro poimba, zvinhu zvache zviri mumba, mbaareke kuburuka kuti azvitore, naiyewo ari kumunda mbaareke kudzoka. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Yeukai mukadzi waRoti. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Wese anotsvaga kuchidza upenyu hwache anotaikihwa nahwo, asi anotaikihwa noupenyu hwache achahuchidza. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ndinokunyepai, pausiku hwakarehwo pachava novairi pamubhedha mubodzi, umwe achatohwa umwe achisiiwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Pachaita vakadzi vairi vachakuya vari pabodzi, umwe achatohwa umwe achisiiwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Varume vairi vachava mumunda, umwe achatohwa umwe achisiiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Ivo vadoti kwaari, “Poi, Ishe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Adoti kwavari, “Pano chitunha ndipo panoungana magora.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo Womujiche Nomutongi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Zvino adovanyepa mufananidzo, waidzoita kuti varambe vachinamata vasingaori mwoyo. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Adoti, “Kuno rimwe guta kwanga kuno mutongi wanga asingache Mwari, kana kuva nobasa nomunhu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Zvino paiva nomujiche muguta rakarero wairamba achiuya kwaari achiti, ‘Ndirungamisire nyaya nomhandu yangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Kwochinguwa wairamba, asi pasure adoti mumwoyo mache, ‘Kana zvangu ndisingache Mwari kana kuva nobasa nomunhu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />asi nondava yokuti mujiche wakareyu ari kundinetsa, ndichamurungamisira, kuti arege kundisembura nokuramba achimbondouya kwandiri.’”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Ishe adoti, “Inzvai zvinonyaihwa nomutongi asinai kururama. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Zvino Mwari angareke nai kurungamisira vasaruhwa vache vanodaidza kwaari masikati nousiku? Angavachehwere nai? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ndinokunyepai, achavarungamisira nokamangu. Zvisinei, panouya Mwanakomana woMunhu achawana kutenda kuripo panyika here?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woMufarisi noMuteresi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Adonyairawo mufananidzo kuno vamwe vaizvivimba kuti vadorurama vachishora vamwe ndokuti, <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Vanhu vairi vadoenda konamata muimba yaMwari, umwe wanga ari muFarisi, umwe ari muteresi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />MuFarisi adomira achinamata ari pache wega achiti, ‘Mwari, ndinokutendai kuti handinai kufanana novamwe vanhu, vanonhafu, vasinai kururama, mhombo, kana kunge muteresi uyu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Ndinotsanya kairi pasondo, ndinopereka chogumi chozvese zvandinowana.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Asi muteresi, adomira kurefu asingasumudze kana chiso yache kudenga asi adozvidukupisa achiti, ‘Mwari, ndinzvireiwo tsitsi inini mutadzi!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Ndinokunyepai kuti, “Murume wakareyu, adoenda kumba kwache waruramisiwa kukunda muFarisi. Ndava wese anozvikwiridzira achaninipisiwa, asi uyo anozvininipisa achakwiridzihwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoropafadza Vana Vadiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mariko 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Zvino vanga vachiuya kwaari notucheche twese kuti atubate, vadzidzi pavadozviona vadovadzumidza. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Asi Jesu adovadaidza ndokuti, “Rekai vana vadiki vauye kwandiri, damba wavarambidza, ndava vadodaiva umambo hwaMwari ngwavo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Chokwadi, ndinokunyepai, wese asingatambire Umambo hwaMwari kunge mwana mudiki anopindaba mahuri.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murume Mupfumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mariko 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Zvino mutongi adomubvunza, “Mudzidzisi adonaka, ndingaitei kuti ndigare nhaka youpenyu husingapere?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Unondidaidzirei kuti adonaka? Hapanai adonaka asi Mwari wega. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Mirairo unoiziva inoti, ‘Reka kuita upombwe, reka kubaya, reka kuba, reka kuita upfakazi hwomabhwodo, kudza baba vako namaako.’”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Iye adoti, “Zvakarezvi zvese ndidozvichengeta kubva paudiki hwangu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Jesu paadozvinzva, adoti kwaari, “Panochibodzi chausati wava nacho. Tengesa zvese zvaunazvo ukovere varombo, ipopo uchava nopfuma kudenga, wouya wonditevera.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Asi paadonzva zvakarezvo adododoma chiso, ndava waiva nopfuma idowanditsa.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Jesu achimunangara adoti, “Maomeroba yazvidoita kuno vapfumi kupinda muumambo hwaMwari! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Ndava zvidotopusira ngamera kupinda nopaboo ronariti pamupfumi kuti apinde muUmambo hwaMwari.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Vaye vadozvinzva vadoti, “Manje mbani angaponesewe?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Asi adoti, “Zvisingakwanisiki kuvanhu kuna Mwari zvinokwanisika.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Pita adoti, “Onai tidosiya misha yedu tichikuteverai.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Zvino adoti kwavari, “Chokwadi, ndinoti kwamuri, hapanai munhu adosiya imba kana mukadzi kana vakoma novanin'ina kana vabereki kana vana, nondava youmambo hwaMwari, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />asingatambire zvizinji zvidopetewa munguwa ino, nomunguwa inouya upenyu husingapere.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonyaira Kochitatu zvokupfa Kwache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mariko 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Achitora vanogumi novairi, adoti kwavari, “Onai, tiri kuenda kuJerusarema, zvese zvidonyohwa novaporofiti pamusoro poMwanakomana woMunhu zvichazazisiwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Ndava achaisiwa mumaoko yovanhu vodzimwe ndudzi, vachamunyadza nokumubata uyanga nokumusvipira mathe, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Vachamurova nokumubaya, nozuva rochitatu achamuka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Asi hapanai chavadonzvitsitsa pazvese zvakarezvi, kunyaira kwakareku kwanga kudosvisvika kwavari, futi havanai kubata zvidotauhwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Rombe Raipemha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mariko 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Paanga wava panyasi noJeriko, murume rombe wanga adogarikika parutivi ponzira achipemha, <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />paainzva mhomho yaifamba, adobvunza kuti zvairevei.<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Vadomuudza, “Jesu woNazareta ari kupinda.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Iye adodaidzira, “Jesu, Mwanakomana waDhavhiti, ndinzvirei tsitsi!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Zvino vaye vanga vari kumberi vadomudzuma, vachimuudza kuti anyarare, asi adotonyanyitsirafuti kudaidzira, “Mwanakomana waDhavhiti, ndinzvirei tsitsi!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Jesu adomira, achiraira kuti vauye naye kwaari, paadosvika papfupi adomubvunza, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Unoda kuti ndikuitire chii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Iye adoti, “Ishe itai kuti ndione.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Jesu adoti, “Chiona, kutenda kwako kwakuporesa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Pakarepo adobva waona ndokumutevera, achirumbidza Mwari, vanhu vese pavadozviona vadokudza Mwari.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Jesu naZakeyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Adopinda nomuJeriko maanga achipindirira. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Panga pano murume waiitiwa Zakeyo, waiva mukuru wovateresi, adopfuma. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Adotsvaga kuona kuti Jesu mbani, asi waigonaba, nondava yovanhu nokuti wanga ari mupfupi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Saka adomhanyira kumberi ndokukwira mumuti womukuyu kuti amuone, nokuti wanga waakupinda nopakarepo. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Zvino Jesu paadosvika pakarepo adonangara mudenga ndokuti kwaari, “Zakeyo, buruka nokamangu, ndava ndinofanira kugara kumba kwako nasi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Saka adokurumidza kuburuka, ndokumutambira nomufaro. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Pavadozviona vese vadonyunyuta, “Wapinda koita murendo womunhu mutadzi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zvino Zakeyo adosumuka ndokuti kuna Ishe, “Onai, Ishe, ndinopereka chikamu chopakati chopfuma yangu kuvarombo, futi kana pano chandabiridzira umwe munhu, ndinochidzotsera chapetewa kanai.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Nasi ruponiso rapinda mumba muno, sezvo naiyewo ari mwanakomana waAbhurahamu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Ndava Mwanakomana woMunhu adouya kotsvaga nokuponesa chidotaika.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo Wogumi roPondo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mateo 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Pavainzva zvinhu zvakarezvi, adoenderera mberi kuvanyepa mufananidzo, ndava wanga wava papfupi noJerusarema, futi vaifunga kuti Umambo hwaMwari huchaoneka nokamangu. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Nokudaro adoti, “Umwe murume, anoremekedzeka adoenda kunyika iri kurefu kopasiwa umambo nokubva wadzoka. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Achidaidza varanda vache, adovapasa gumi ropondo, achiti kwavari, ‘Itai maronda nayo kusvikira ndauya.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Asi nzvahwa dzachedzo dzaimuzonda dzidotumira mumiririri mumasure mache dzichiti, ‘Tinodaba murume wakareyo kuti atitonge.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Paadozodzoka wapasiwa umambo, adoraira varanda vakarevo vaadopasa mari, kuti vadaidziwe kuenda kwaari kuti azive zvavadowana pakuita maronda. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Wokuthanga adouya kwaari achiti, ‘Ishe, pondo yenyu yazvara dzimwe pondo gumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Iye adoti kwaari, ‘Waita mushe muranda adonaka! Ndava wanga udotendeka pazvishoma, uchava mukuru womaguta gumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Wochipiri adouya ndokuti, ‘Ishe, pondo yenyu yazvara pondo dzishano.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Zvino adoti kwaari, ‘Uchava mukuru womaguta mashano.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Zvino umwe adouya achiti, ‘Ishe, pondo yenyu iyi yandidoputira nojira, <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />ndava ndaikuchai, nokuti muri murume mukukutu, munotora chamusinai kuisa, munokohwa chamusinai kujara.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Adoti kwaari, ‘Ndichakutonga nomashoko yomuromo wako, iwe muranda adoipa! Waziva zvako kuti ndiri murume mukukutu, anotora paasinai kuisa nokukohwa pandisinai kujara. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Anga zvino udosairei kuisa mari yangu kubhengi, kuti pakuuya kwangu ndidzoitora yabereka?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Zvino adoti kuno vanga vadomira pakarepo, ‘Mutorerei pondo, muipase kuno ano gumi ropondo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Ivo vadoti kwaari, ‘Ishe, ano gumi ropondo!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />‘Ndinokunyepai, kuti kuno anazvo achapasiwa zvizinji, asi asinai, nochaanofunga kuti anacho achatorehwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Asi kana vari vavengi vangu ava, vanga vasingade kuti ndivatonge, uyai navo pano muvabaire pamberi pangu.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupinda MuJerusarema Achipemberehwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mariko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Johwani 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Wapedza kunyaira zvakarezvi, adopfuurira mberi kuenda kuJerusarema. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Wava panyasi noBhetifegi noBhetani, pagomo rinoitiwa roMiorivhi, adotuma vadzidzi vache vairi, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />achiti, “Pindai mumusha udonangarana nemi, pamunopinda muchawana kamhuru koburu kadosungirihwa, kasati kasinai kumbogadhiwa nomunhu, kasugudurei muuye nako kuno. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Kana paita anokubvunzai kuti, ‘Muri kukasugudurirei?’ Munyepei kuti, ‘Ishe vari kukada.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Saka vaye vadotumiwa vadoenda, ndokuzviwana zvidoita sekunyaira kwache. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Pavanga vachisugudura kamhuru, venekachiro vakene vadoti kwavari, “Muri kukasugudurirei kamhuru koka?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Ivo vadoti, “Ishe vari kukada.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Zvino vadouya nako kuna Jesu, ndokukhandira hembe dzavo pakamwana koburu kuti Jesu adzigarire adokagadha. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Achienda adogadha daipo, vadowaridza hembe dzavo munzira.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Paanga wava papfupi, nopamateru yogomo roMiorivhi, gurusvusvu rese rovadzidzi ridothanga kufara nokurumbidza Mwari nomadzinga yopamusoro nondava yomabasa yese yosimba yavadoona. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Vaiti, “Adokomborehwa Mambo anouya muzita raIshe! Runyararo kudenga nokubhwinya kumusorosoro!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Vamwe vaFarisi vanga vari mugurusvusvu vadoti kwaari, “Mudzidzisi, dzumai vadzidzi venyu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Adopindura, “Ndinokuudzai, kana ava vakanyarara, mabhwe chaiyo yanothanga kudaidzira.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoririra Jerusarema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Paadosebera panyasi achiona guta adoriririra, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />achiti, “Dai waitoziva iye nasi chaiye zvinhu zvinouyisa runyararo! Asi manje zvidohwanziwa kubva pameso yako. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ndava mazuva yachakusvikira apo vavengi vako vachakupoteredza, vachikuvharira kumativi yese, <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Vachikuphomorera pasi, iwepa novana vako vari mauri, vanodzosiyaba dombo riri pamusoro porimwe mauri, ndava haunai kuziva nguwa yokubvakachihwa kwako.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoenda kuImba yaMwari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mariko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Johwani 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Zvino adopinda muimba yaMwari ndokuthanga kudzinga vaitengesa, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />achiti kwavari, “Kudonyohwa kuti, ‘Imba yangu ichava imba yokunamatira,’ asi imimi muri kuiita bako romakororo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Waidzidzisa ari muImba yaMwari mazuva yese. Vaphirisita vakuru, novanyori novakuru vovanhu vadotsvaga maparadziro yavaidzomuita, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />asi havanai kuwana chinhu chavaigona kuita, nokuti vanhu vese vanga vadondobatirira pamashoko yache.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo Pamusoro Posimba raJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mariko 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Rimwe zuva, achidzidzisa vanhu muimba yaMwari nokuparidza vhangeri, vaphirisita vakuru novanyori novakuru vadouya <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />vachiti kwaari, “Tinyepe kuti isimba hwai raunoita naro zvinhu zvakarezvi, kana naiye adokupasa simbaro.”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Jesu adovapindura, “Naininiwo ndichakubvunzai mubvunzo, mundinyepe ipopano. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Ko ruombeko raJohwani rudobva kudenga chere kana kuvanhu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Vadokurukurirana vachiti, “Kana tikati, ‘Rudobva kudenga,’ achati, ‘Mudoregerei kumutenda?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Asi kana tikati, ‘Rudobva kuvanhu,’ vanhu vese vachatitema nomatombo, ndava vanotenda kuti Johwani wanga ari muporofiti.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Saka vadodzopindura kuti vanga vasingazive kwaridobva.<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Zvino Jesu adoti kwavari, “Naininiwo handikunyepei kuti ndinoita zvinhu zvakarezvi nosimba ripi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo Wovarimi Vokuronjeresa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mariko 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Adothanga kuudza vanhu mufananidzo wokuti, “Umwe munhu adorima mazambiringa mudimba, ndokuronjeresa, achibva waenda kuimwe nyika kwonguwa irefu. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Padosvika nguwa, adotuma muranda kuno vaadoronjeresa, kuti vamupase imwe michero yomunda womazambiringa, asi varimi ivovo vadomurova, ndokumudzotsa asinai chinhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Zvino adotuma umwe muranda, naiyeyuwo vadomurova nokumubata uyanga, vachimudzotsa ari manja vhuzuvhuzu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Adotuma kamu wochitatu, uyu vadomukuwadza ndokumudzingira kunze. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Ipopo mwenekachiro womazambiringa adoti, ‘Ndichaita tini? Ndichatuma mwanakomana wangu anodikana, pamwe vangamuremekedze.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Asi varimi pavadomuona vadotaurirana vachiti, ‘Iyeyu ndiye muji wonhaka, mbatimubaye, kuti nhaka ive yedu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Saka vadomudzingira kunze kwomunda womizambiringa ndokumubaya. Zvino chii chichaitiwa kwavari nomwenekachiro womizambiringa? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Achauya achiparadza varimi vakarevo, achipasa munda womizambiringa kuno vamwewo.” Pavadonzva zvakarezvi vadoti, “Hazvifanire kudaro!” <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Asi adovanangara ndokuti kwavari, “Chii, manje ichi, chidonyohwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Iro ribwe rokurambiwa novavakhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">ndiro radzova musoro wokhona.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Wese anowira padombo rakarero achagwatikagwatika, asi pakava nowarinowira rinomukuya.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo Pamusoro Pomitero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mariko 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Vanyori novaphirisita vakuru vadoedza kumubata panguwa yakareyo, asi vadocha vanhu, ndava vadozingwa kuti adotaura mufananidzo wakareyu achireva ivo. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Saka vadomuteya, vachimutumira vashori vaiedzesera kuva pachokwadi, kuti vamubate nomashoko yache, kuti vagone kumupereka kunovanoukuru nokusimba romutongi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Vadomubvunza vachiti, “Mudzidzisi, tinoziva kuti munonyaira nokudzidzisa zvidorungama, musingaite tsvete, asi munodzidzisa nzira yaMwari muchokwadi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Ko zviri pamutemo chere kuti tiripe mitero kuna Khesari, kana kuti tireke?” <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Asi Jesu adoziva mambere yavo, ndokuti kwavari, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Ndinangidzei dhinari racho. Ko chiso nomunembo zviri pakarepa nzvani?” Ivo vadoti kwaari, “NzvaKesari.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Adodzoti kwavari, “Perekai kuna Khesari zvinhu zvaKesari, nokuna Mwari zvinhu zvaMwari.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Vadotadzirira kumubata pamanyairiro yache pamberi povanhu, asi pakushamisika nomhinduro yache vadodzondonyarara.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo Pamusoro Pokumuka Kwovadopfa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mariko 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />VaSadhusi vadouya kwaari, ivo vanoti hakunai kumuka kwovadopfa, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Vadomubvunza mubvunzo vachiti, “Mudzidzisi, Mozisi adotinyorera kuti kana mukoma womunhu wapfa achisiya mukadzi wache asinai vana, munin'ina womupfi mbaatore mukadzi amutsire vana kumukoma wache. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Manje paiva novanakomana vanomwe, vomunhu mubodzi. Wokuthanga adotora mukadzi, ndokupfa asinai vana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Wochipiri <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />nowochitatu vadomutorawo, futi vese vari vanomwe vadomutora ndokupfa pasinai adoita vana naye. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Pasure mukadziyo adodzopfawo. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Manje pakumuka kwovadopfa, mukadzi wakareyo achava waani? Nokuti vanomwe vadomuita mukadzi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Vanhu vonguwa ino vanoroora nokuroodzewa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />asi avo vanonzi vadofanira kupinda munguwa iyoyo nomukumuka kwovadopfa vanorooraba kana kuroodzewa, <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Ndava vachapfaba, nokuti vadoenzana nongirozi pakare mbana vaMwari, zvavari vanakomana vokumuka kuvadopfa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Asi zvokuti vadopfa vanomuka, kana Mozisi adozvinangidza pandima yodzambwa raipfuta, paanodaidza Ishe kuti Mwari waAbhurahamu naMwari waIsaki naMwari waJakobho. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Manje haazi Mwari wovadopfa asi wovapenyu, ndava kwaari vese mbapenyu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Zvino vamwe vanyori vadopindura, “Mudzidzisi, mapindura bhwino.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ndava vadodzotsungaba kumubvunza chero mubvunzo.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo Pamusoro paMesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mariko 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Asi adoti kwavari, “Vanotaura tini vachiti Khirisitu Mwanakomana waDhavhiti?” <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Ndava Dhavhiti pachake mubhuku raMaphisarema anoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Ishe adoti kuna Ishe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Gara kuruoko rangu roruji,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />kusvikira ndaita vavengi vako chitsiko chotsoka dzako.”<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />“Manje kana Dhavhiti achimudaidza kuti Ishe, anodzova Mwanakomana wache tini?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anovachenjedza Pamusoro Povadzidzisi Vomutemo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mariko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Vanhu vese vachinzva adoti kuvadzidzi vache, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Chenjererai vanyori vanofarira kufamba vadosimira majasi marefu, vachida kumoresewa mumisika nokugara pamipando idonakitsitsa mumasinagoge nonzvimbo dzokukudziwa pamabiko, <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />vanoparadza dzimba dzovajiche vachinyepera kuita minamato mirefu. Vachapasiwa mhosva ikuru.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Chipo Chomujiche</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mariko 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Adonangara ndokuona vapfumi vachiisa zvipo zvavo muchivigiro. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Adoona umwe mujiche murombo achiisa tumari twokopa tuiri. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Adobva wati, “Chokwadi ndinokunyepai, mujiche uyu murombo wapa zvizinji kukunda vese, <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />ndava vese vapereka kubva pazvizinji zvavanazvo, asi iye paurombo hwache waisa zvese zvaimuraramisa zvaanga anazvo.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonyaira Zvokuparara kwoImba yaMwari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mariko 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Pavanga vachinyaira nozvoimba yaMwari, mashongedzehwo yayanga idoitiwa nomabhwe yanokosha nozvipo zvidopasiwa kuna Mwari adoti kwavari, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Kana zviri zvinhu izvi zvamunoona, mazuva yachauya pasingadzosiiwa ibhwe riri pamusoro porimwe risingazokoromorehwa pasi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhamu Nokutambudziwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mariko 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Ivo vadomubvunza, “Mudzidzisi, izvozvi zvichava rini, futi nyhipi chichava chiratidzo chokuti zvaakuitika?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Adoti, “Chenjerai kuti mureke kutsambutsiwa, ndava vazinji vachauya muzita rangu vachiti, ‘Ndini iye!’ Rekai kuvatevera. Futi ‘Nguwa yava papfupi!’ <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Zvino kana mava kunzva zvohondo nokumukirana, rekai kuvhunduka, ndava zvakarezvi zvinofanira kuitika asi kuguma kunenge kusati kwasvika.” <verse eid="LUK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Zvino adoti kwavari, “Rudzi ruchamukira rimwe rudzi, noumambo huchamukira umwe umambo, <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />kuchavapo kugwetedzeka kukuru kwonyika, nokunzvimbo dzizinji kuchava nonzara nomatenda, futi kuchaita zvinhu zvinochisa nozviratidzo zvikuru zvichabva kudenga. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Asi zvakarezvi zvese zvisati zvaitika vachakusungai nokukutambudzai, vachikuendesai kumasinagoge nokumatorongo, futi muchaisiwa pamberi pomadzimambo novatongi nokuda kwozita rangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Iyi ichava nguwa yokuti mupe upfakazi. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Saka zvizivei mupfungwa dzenyu, kuti hamugare magadzirira zvokupindura, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />ndava ndichakupasai muromo nouchenjeri, zvisingagonewe kukomwesewa kana kupikisiwa nomhandu dzenyu dzese. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Muchaisiwa munjodzi novabereki chaivo novakoma nohama futi noshamwari, vamwe venyu vachabaiwa, <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />muchazondewa novese pamusaka pozita rangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Asi hapanai kana bvudzi romusoro wenyu richaparara. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Nokutsungirira kwenyu muchawana upenyu hwenyu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonyaira Zvokuparadziwa KwoJerusarema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mateo 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mariko 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Asi pamunoona Jerusarema rapoteredzewa nomauto, moziva kuti kuparadziwa kwarene kwava papfupi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Ipopo vanenge vari muJudhiya mbavatizire kumakomo, novaye vanenge vari muguta mbavatobirikira futi, novari kumamisha mbavareke kupinda muguta, <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />nokuti yakareya mazuva yokutsiva, kuzadzisa zvese zvidonyorewa. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Nhamu kuno vanomimba novanomwisa pamazuva yakareyo! Ndava kutambudzika kukuru kuchava panyika noukari pamusoro povanhu vakareva. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Vachabaiwa nobakatwa, vopambiwa vachiendesewa kumarudzi yese, Jerusarema richatsikiwa novanhu voyamwe marudzi, kusvikira nguwa yovanhu vakarevo yazazisiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kwoMwanakomana woMunhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mariko 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Kuchava nozviratidzo pazuva, pamwedzi nopanyenyedzi. Marudzi yovanhu panyika vachasaya kudekhara, vachakanganisika nokuunga kwogungwa parinenge richiita mapfeni. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Vanhu vachawa chikhomo nokucha pavanenge vachitarisira zvinhu zviri kuuya panyika, ndava masimba yokudenga yachagwetedzeka. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Pakarepo vachaona Mwanakomana woMunhu achiuya nomakuti nomasimba nokubhwinya kukuru. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Zvino kana zvinhu zvakarezvi zvathanga kuitika, sumudzai misoro yenyu muone, ndava kusununguhwa kwenyu kwava papfupi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chidzidzo kubva paMukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mariko 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Futi adovaudza mufananidzo, “Nangarai mukuyu, noimwe miti yese, <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />kana yava kupfunda mazani, munoona mega nokuziva kuti mainza yatova papfupi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Saka kana maakuona zvinhu zvakarezvi zvichiitika, munoziva kuti Umambo hwaMwari hwasvedera. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Chokwadi, ndinoti kwamuri, vanhu vonguwa yakarei vanopfuuraba kusvikira zvese zvaitika. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Denga nonyika zvinopera, asi mashoko yangu yanoperaba.”<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugaririra Kunodiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Asi zvichenjererei kuti mwoyo yenyu ireke kunetesewa nokuita nhafu nokukorewa nokuchira upenyu huno, kuti zuva rakarero rikusvikirei kabodzi nokabodzi kunge riva, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />ndava richauya pamusoro povese vanogara pasi pese. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Asi garirirai nguwa dzese, muchinamata kuti muve nosimba rokupunyuka pazvinhu zvakarezvi zvese zvichaitika, nokumira pamberi poMwanakomana womunhu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Mazuva yese waidzidzisa muimba yaMwari, asi mauro waienda kwaaigara kugomo raiitiwa romuOrivhi. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Mambakwedza vanhu vese vaiuya kwaari muimba yaMwari kudzomunzva.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Kurangana Kubaya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mariko 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Johwani 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Zvino mutambo woMazingwa Yasinai Mbiriso unodaidziwa kuti Phasika, wanga wava papfupi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Vaphirisita vakuru novanyori vaitsvaga mabairo yavaidzomuita, ndava vaicha vanhu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judhasi Anobvuma Kutengesa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mariko 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Manje Sathani adopinda muna Judhasi waiitiwa Sikariyoti, waiverengehwa pagumi novairi, <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />adobirika ndokuenda korangana novaphirisita vakuru novatungamiri matengesero yaaidzomuita kwavari. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Ivo vadofara, ndokuronga kumupasa mari. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Saka adobvuma, ndokutsvaga mukana wokumutengesa kwavari pasinai gurusvusvu.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anogadzirira Kuja Phasika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mariko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Johwani 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Zvino zuva roMazingwa Yasinai Mbiriso ridosvika, apo hwayana rophasika raidzoitiwa chipiriso. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Saka Jesu adotuma Pita naJohwani, achiti, “Endai kotigadzirira phasika, kuti tiije.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Vadoti kwaari, “Nghupi kwamunoda kuti tiigadzirire?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Onai, kana mapinda muguta, muchakumana nomurume adotakura chirongo chomvura, muteverei mumba maachapinda, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />futi udzai mwenekachiro woimba, ‘Mudzidzisi ari kuti kwauri, iripoi imba yovarendo, mandichajira novadzidzi vangu zigwa rophasika risinai mbiriso?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Iye achakunangidzai kamuri ikuru yopamusoro idorongedzewa, tigadzirirei makaremo. <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Ivo vadoenda, ndokuwana zvidoita semanyairiro yaadovaitira, saka vadobva vagadzira phasika.”<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chirairo chaIshe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mariko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Vakorinde 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Nguwa paidosvika, adogarikika patafura ano nhumwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Ndaiditsa kuja naimimi phasika yakarei ndisati ndatambudzika, <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />nokuti ndinokunyepai kuti ndichaijaba kusvikira yazazisiwa muumambo hwaMwari.” <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Adotora mukombe, paadopa kutenda adoti, “Utorei wakareyu, mukovane pakati penyu, <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />ndava ndinokuudzai kuti kubva zvino ndichamwaba zvomuchero womuzambiringa kusvikira umambo hwaMwari hwauya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Futi adotora zingwa, paadorinamatira adorikomora ndokuvapasa achiti, “Uyu muviri wangu unopasiwa kwamuri. Itai zvakarezvi muchindifunga.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ndomwenze pamukombe padopera kuja kwomauro, achiti, “Mukombe uyu udodururiwa nokuda kwenyu ndicho chibvumirano chitsva mugazi rangu. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Asi onai ruoko raiye ari kundipandukira rinainini pathafura. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Nokuti Mwanakomana womunhu anoenda sekutahwa kwazvidoitiwa, asi nhamu kumunhu wakareyo anomupandukira.” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Ipopo vadothanga kubvunzana kuti ngupi pavari waidzoita izvozvi.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nharo pamusoro poUkuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Nharo dzidomukawo pakati pavo, kuti mbani wavo waidzotorewa semukuru. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Achibva wati kwavari, “Madzimambo yoMarudzi yanovashandisira ukuru, noavo vanomasimba pamusoro pavo vanonzi mbabatsiri. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Asi mbazvirege kudaro kwamuri, hasa kuti mukuru pakati penyu ave kunge mudikitsa, nomutungamiri aite kunge mushandi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Nokuti ngupi mukuru, pano adogarikika pathafura, noanotenaira? Handiti mukuru nguyo anogarikika pathafura? Asi inini ndiri pakati penyu semutenairi. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Ndimi vaye vadoramba vanainini pakuedzewa kwangu, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />inipano ndidokusarudzirai umambo, fanike masarudzihwo yandidohuitihwa naBaba vangu, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />kuti muje nokumwa pathafura yangu muumambo hwangu, uye mugarikike pamipando muchitonga marudzi gumi nomairi yovaIzirairi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anozivisa Kuramba kwaPita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mariko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Johwani 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Simoni, Simoni, ziva kuti Sathani adopopera kukutorai kuti akuungurei kunge gorosi, <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />asi ndidokunamatira kuti kutenda kwako kureke kukundikana, futi kana wadzodzoka pakare, simbisa abiyako.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Adoti kwaari, “Ishe, ndidozvigadzirira kuenda kutorongo futi nokutopfa pabodzi naimimi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Jesu adoti, “Ndinokunyepa Pita, jongwe rinoriraba nasi, usati waramba katatu, kuti unondiziva.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chikwama, Nhava noBakatwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Futi adoti kwavari, “Pandidokutumai musinai chikwama kana nhava, kana shangu, pano chamudosaya chere?” Vadoti, “Hapanai.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Achibva wati kwavari, “Asi manje ano chikwama mbaatore, noanonhava mbaatore, futi asinai bakatwa mbaatengese jasi rache atenge ribodzi. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Nokuti ndinokunyepai kuti rugwaro rakareri rinofanira kuzazisiwa mandiri, ‘Futi adoverengewa pabodzi novatadzi,’ ndava zvidonyohwa pamusoro pangu zvinokuzazisiwa kwazvene.” <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Futi vadoti, “Nangarai, Ishe, pano pane mapakatwa mairi.” Adoti kwavari, “Zvatokwana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonamata paGomo romiOrivhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mariko 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Futi adobirika achienda kugomo roMiorivhi, semaitiro yache, vadzidzi vadomutevera. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Futi paadosvika panzvimbo adoti kwavari, “Namatai kuti mureke kupinda pakuedzewa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Futi adobirika kubva pavari ndokuenda pamberi zvishoma, adopfugama ndokunamata achiti, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Baba, kana muchida biritsai mukombe uyu kwandiri, zvisinei mbakureke kuva kuda kwangu, asi kuda kwenyu, mbakuitiwe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Padooneka ngirozi idobva kudenga ichimusimbisa. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ari pakutambudzika kukuru adonamata zvidonyanya. Dukuta rinenge madonhwe yogazi ridodonha pasi. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Futi paadosumuka kubva pakunamata, adoenda kuvadzidzi ndokuvawana vatoenzera nondava yokusuwa, <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />achibva wati kwavari, “Munoenzerereiko? Mukai munamate kuti mureke kupinda pamuedzo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusungiwa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mariko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Johwani 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Paanga achiri kutaura, padouya gurusvusvu, futi murume anoitiwa Judhasi, umwe wovanogumi novairi, anga achivatungamirira. Iye adonyedza papfupi naJesu kuti amutsvode, <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />asi Jesu adoti kwaari, “Judhasi, ungatengese Mwanakomana woMunhu nokutsvoda?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Zvino vaye vanga vanaye pavadondoona zvanga zvava kuitika, vadoti, “Ishe, tikhwape nomapakatwa here?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Umwe wavo adokhwapa nzeve yokuruji yomuranda womuphirisita mukuru ndokuigwata. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Asi Jesu adoti, “Izvozvo zvakwana.” Futi adobata nzeve yache achimuporesa. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ipopo Jesu adoti kuvapirisita vakuru novabati voimba yaMwari novakuru, vanga vauya kudzomusunga, “Mabirika kunge muri kuhwisa gananga, mudopakata bakatwa nonduni? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Pandanga ndinaimimi muimba yaMwari zuva nozuva, hamunai kundibata. Asi yakarei inguwa yenyu, noyomasimba yorima.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Anoramba Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mateo 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mariko 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Johwani 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ipopo vadomusunga ndokuenda naye, vachimuisa kumba kwomuphirisita mukuru. Pita adovatevera ari kurefu, <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />pavadobatidza moto pakati pochivanze vachigara vese pabodzi, Pita adogara pakati pavo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Zvino mushandisikana achimuona adogara pachiedze adomunangaritsa, ndokuti, “Murume wakareyu anga anaye futi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Asi adozviramba achiti, “Amai imi, handimuzivi ini.” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Pamasure pokanguwa kapfupi umwewo adomuona ndokuti, “Iwewe uri mabiyavo.” Asi Pita adopindura achiti, “Vakuru, ndiniba!” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Mumasure mochinguwa chinenge awa ibodzi umwe kamu adosimbisa achiti, “Chokwadi murume uyu wanga anaye, ndava ndowomuGaririya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Asi Pita adoti, “Vakuru imi, ndinozivaba zvamunonyaira.” Ipopo achiri kutaura, jongwe ridorira. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Ishe adocheuka ndokunangara Pita. Zvino Pita adobva watondera shoko raIshe, raadonyaira kwaari achiti, “Uchandiramba katatu nasi Jongwe risati rarira.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Adobirika achienda korira zvinosiririsa.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunyadziwa noKurohwa KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mateo 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mariko 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Zvino varume vanga vadosunga Jesu vadomunyadza nokumurova, <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />vadomusunga pakamu mumaziso zvokariroriro ndokunyaira kwaari vachiti, “Porofita! Mbani wakurova?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Vadonyaira mashoko yadowanda yokumunyomba, vachimushora.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Pamberi Podare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mariko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Johwani 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Kwachena, ungano yovakuru vovanhu idoungana pabodzi, kusanganisira vaphirisita vakuru novanyori, vadoenda naye kudare ravo, vachibva vati, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />“Kana uri Khirisitu, tiudze.” Asi iye adoti kwavari, “Kana ndikakuudzai, hamungatende, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />futi kana ndikakubvunzai, munondipinduraba. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Asi kubva zvino Mwanakomana womunhu achagara kuruoko roruji rosimba raMwari.” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Vese vachibva vati, “Saka ndiwe Mwanakomana waMwari here?” Iye ndokuti kwavari, “Manyaira kuti ndini.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Futi vadoti, “Tichadireiko pfakazi pakare? Tazvinzvira tega kubva pamuromo wache.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Pamberi paPirato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mariko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Johwani 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Zvino chaunga chavo chese chidosumuka, chichimuendesa pamberi paPirato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Futi vadothanga kumupomera, vachiti, “Tidowana murume uyu achitsambutsa rudzi hwedu, achitirambidza kupereka mitero kuna Khesari, achiti iye pachake ndiKhirisitu mambo.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pirato adomubvunza achiti, “Ndiwe Mambo wovaJudha chere?” Iye adomupindura achiti, “Ndozvawareva.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Saka Pirato adodzoti kuvaprista vakuru nokumhomho yovanhu, “Handinai mhosva yandawana pamunhu uyu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Asi vadokurumidza kuti, “Adomutsa vanhu, achidzidzisa kwesekwese muJudhiya rese, kubva muGaririya kutosvika kunzvimbo ino.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anomira Pamberi paHerudhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pirato paadonzva zvakarezvo, adobvunza kana murume wakareyo waiva woGaririya. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Futi paadondoziva kuti waiva wonzvimbo iri pasi poutongi hwaHerudhe, adomuendesa kuna Herudhe, wanga ari muJerusarema pachake panguwa yakareyo. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Herudhe paadoona Jesu, adofara maninge, ndava kwonguwa irefu waida kumuona, nondava yokuti wanga wanzva nozvache, futi waigurupira kuona zviratidzo zvaiitiwa naye. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Saka adomubvunza kwochinguwa asi haanai kupindura. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Vaphirisita vakuru novanyori vadomira pakarepo, vachimupomera zvidosimba. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Futi Herudhe novahwi vache vadomubata uyanga vachimunyadza, ndokudzomusimidza chipfeko chinobhwinya, ndokumudzotsa kuna Pirato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Futi Herudhe naPirato vadoita ushamwari pazuva rakarero, ndava kare vanga vadozondana.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotongehwa Ipfa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mariko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Johwani 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pirato adodaidza pabodzi vaphirisita vakuru novatongi novanhu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />ndokuti kwavari, “Mauya nomunhu wakareyu kwandiri semunhu wanga achitsambutsa vanhu, asi mumasure mokumuongorora pamberi penyu, mazviona kuti handinai kuwana munhu uyu ano mhosva yozvese zvamuri kumunenedzera, <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />naHerudhe haanaiwo, ndosaka wamudzotsa kamu kwatiri. Onai, hapanai chaadoita chinokodzera ipfa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Saka ndichamuranga ndomusunungura.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Nokuti zvanga zvidokodzera kuti avasunungurire musungwa mubodzi pamutambo.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:18-23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:20-23">Mateo 27:20-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:11-14">Mariko 15:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:38-40">Johwani 18:38-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:14-15">19:14-15</ref>.</char>
    </note> Asi vese vadodaidzira pabodzi vachiti, “Mbaabiritsiwe munhu wakareyo! Tisunungurirei Bharabhasi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Munhu wanga adokhandiwa mutorongo nondava yobopoto ridoitiwa muguta, futi nondava yokuponda. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pirato adotaura navo pakare, achida kusunungura Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Asi vadodaidzira vachiti, “Murovererei, murovererei!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Kochitatu adoti kwavari, “Nondava yei, waita chidoipa chipi? Ndaona paari pasinai mhosva idokodzera ipfa, saka ndichandomuranga ndomusunungura.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Asi nokamangu vadopopera vachidaidzira nomazvi yopamusoro kuti mbaarovehwe. Zvino mazvi yavo yadokunda. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Saka Pirato adodzondotongera kuti zvavaipopera vazviitihwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Adosunungura murume wavadokumbira wanga adokhandiwa mutorongo nondava yomunyonga uye nondava nokuponda, asi adopereka Jesu kuzvido zvavo.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anorovehwa Pamuchinjikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mariko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Johwani 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Pavanga vachienda naye, vadobata murume waiitiwa Simoni woKhurini, wanga achipinda achibva kumusha, ndokumutakudza muchinjikwa ari mumasure maJesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Futi adotevehwa nogurusvusvu rovanhu vazinji, novakadzi vanga vachimurira nokumuchema. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Asi Jesu adochununguka kwavari achiti, “Vanasikana voJerusarema, rekai kundirira, asi zvirirei imimi novana venyu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ndava onai, mazuva yari kuuya pavachati, ‘Vadokomborehwa vasingazvari, nozvibereko zvisinai kumbozvara, nomazamu yasinai kumbomwiwa!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Ipopo vachathanga kuti kumakomo, ‘Tiwirei,’ nokututunhu, ‘Tisvisvei.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Ndava kana vachidai kumuti munyoro, chii chichaitika kana waoma?” <verse eid="LUK 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Vamwe vairi kamu, vanga vari makororo, vaiendesewa kobaiwa pabodzi naye. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Pavadosvika panzvimbo inoitiwa Dehenya, pakarepo vadomurovera, nomakororo, umwe kuruji umwe kurubose. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Zvino Jesu adoti, “Baba, varekererei, ndava vanozivaba zvavanoita.” Vadokhanda hakata kuti vakovane majasi yache. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Vanhu vadondomira pakarepo vadonangara, asi vatongi vadomushora, vachiti, “Adoponesa vamwe, mbaazviponese kana ari Khirisitu waMwari, Musaruhwa wache!” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Vahwi vadomunyadzawo, vadouya vachimupasa vhiniga, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />vachiti, “Kana uri Mambo wovaJudha, zviponese!” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Panga panochinyohwa pakare pamusoro pache, “Uyu ndiye Mambo wovaJudha.” <verse eid="LUK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Umwe womakororo wanga adoturikiwa adomumbombodzera, achiti, “Ndiweba Khirisitu nai? Zviponese naisisuwo!” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Asi mabiyake adomudzuma, achiti, “Hauche Mwari nai, zvauri pakutongehwa mutongo mubodzi? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Isisu zvidokodzera, ndava tiri kutambira mubairo udofanira zviito zvedu, asi murume uyu haanai kuita chidoipa.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Adobva wati, “Jesu mundirangarire kana mopinda muumambo hwenyu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Adoti kwaari, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwauri, nasi uchava nainini muParadhaisi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupfa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mariko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Johwani 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Yanga yava awa yochitanhatu, padoita rima panyika yese kusvikira paawa yochipfemba, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />zvichiita daipo chiedza chozuva chidodzimwa, jira romuimba yaMwari ndokukeruka nopakati. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Ipopo Jesu adodaidzira nodzinga rikuru achiti, “Baba, ndinoisa mweya wangu mumaoko yenyu!” Paadondotaura zvakarezvo adobva warosa. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Zvino mutungamiri wozana paadoona zvidoitika adokudza Mwari achiti, “Chokwadi murume uyu wanga asinai mhosva!” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Gurusvusvu rese ranga raungana kudzoona zvanga zvichiitika, pavadoona vadokotamisa zviso nondava yokusiririsiwa nazvo, ndokudzokera kudzimba dzavo. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Vazikani vache vese novanhukadzi vanga vamutevera kubva kuGaririya vadomira kurefu vachiona zvinhu zvakarezvi.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvigiwa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mariko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Johwani 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Zvino kwaiva nomurume waiitiwa Josefa waibva muguta rovaJudha roAramatiya. Waiva umwe wovodare, ari munhu adonaka adorurama, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />iye anga asinai kuwirirana nochinangwa chavo nozvavadoita, wanga adotarisira umambo hwaMwari. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Murume wakareyu adoenda kuna Pirato ndokukumbira chitunha chaJesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Adochiburutsa ndokuchiputiridza nofuko, achimuradzika muguwa ridofongewa padombo, ranga risati ramboradzikiwa munhu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ranga riri zuva roGadziriro, Sabata yanga yaakuthanga. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Vakadzi vanga vauya naye kubva kuGaririya vadotevera ndokuona guwa, nomaradzikihwo yadoitiwa mutumbi wache, <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Zvino vadodzokera, vachibva vagadzira zvinonushira nozvokuzora. PaSabata vadozorora maringe nomutemo.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Kumuka KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mateo 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mariko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Johwani 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Asi nomusi wokuthanga kwosondo, mambakwedza, vadouya kuguwa, vadotakura zvinonushira zvavanga vagadzira. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Vadowana dombo rakungurutsiwa kubva paguwa, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Vadopinda mukati, ndokusaya mutumbi waIshe Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Pavanga vachiri kunetseka nazvo, padomira varume vairi vaiva vadosimira zvinoyetima, <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />pavadovhunduka, nokutogurama zviso zvavo pasi, varume vakarevo vadoti kwavari, sei muri kutsvaga mupenyu pakati povadopfa? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Haazi pano, wamuka, yeukai zvaadotaura kwamuri paanga achiri muGaririya, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />achiti, “Mwanakomana womunhu anofanira kuisiwa mumanja yovatadzi, woroverehwa, pazuva rochitatu womuka pakare.” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Vadobva varangarira mashoko yache, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />vadodzoka vachibva paguwa ndokuudza vanogumi nomubodzi novamwe vese zvinhu zvakarezvo zvese. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Vakarevo vanga vari Mariya Magadharina, naJoana, naMariya amai vaJakobho, novamwe vakadzi vavanga vanavo vadoudza nhumwa zvakarezvi, <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />asi mazvi yakareya yadoita kunge chinzano kwavari, havanai kuvatenda. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Asi Pita adosumuka, ndokuita ruviro kumhanyira kuguwa, paadokotama adondoona mapiza basi yari payene yega. Adobirika pakarepo ndokuenda kumba, achishamisika kuti chii changa chaitika.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vairi Vaienda kuEmausi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12">Mariko 16:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Pazuva rakarero vairi vavo vanga vachienda kumusha unoitiwa Emausi, huri yomamaera masere kubva kuJerusarema. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />futi vadotaurirana zvinhu zvakarezvi zvese zvanga zvaitika. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Zvidoitika kuti pavaitaura daipo vachibvunzana, Jesu pachake adonyedza papfupi, ndokuenda navo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Asi meso yavo yadoita buzvi ndokutadza kumuziva. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Adobva wati kwavari, “Hukurukurirana kworudzii kwamunoita muchitekaira daipa?” Vadobva vamira, vadosuwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Umwe wacho waiitiwa Khiropasi, adomupindura achiti, “Ndiwe wega nai murendo muJerusarema asingazive zvinhu zvidoitika mazuva yano?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Iye adobva wati, “Zvinhu zvokuti chii?” Vadoti kwaari, “Zviri maererano naJesu woNazareta, wanga ari muporofiti anosimba pabasa nopashoko pamberi paMwari novanhu vese, <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />nomaperekehwo yaadoitiwa novaphirisita vedu vakuru novatongi kuti atongehwe ipfa, futi kuti aroverehwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Asi Tanga tichitogurupira kuti ndiye achadzikinura vaIzirairi. Futi pamusoro pozvakarezvi zvese, rino rava zuva rochitatu kubva pazvidoitika. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Ukuwo, vamwe vakadzi voboka redu vatishamisa, vanga vari kuguwa mambakwedza. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Havanai kuwana mutumbi wache. Vadzoka vachiti vaona chiratidzo chongirozi, ndokubva dzavanyepa kuti mupenyu. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Vabiyedu vatanga tinavo vaenda kuguwa, ndokuwana zvidoita sekutauhwa kwazvanga zvaitiwa novakadzi, asi iye havanai kumuona.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Adobva wati kwavari, “O varume madzemwa, muno mwoyo inochehwa kutenda zvese zvidorehwa novaporofiti! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Zvanga zvisinai kufanira chere kuti Khirisitu atambudzike zvidodai achidzopinda mukubhwinya kwache?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Adothanga kubva pana Mozisi nokuvaporofiti vese, adovadudzira zvomumagwaro yese zviri maererano naye pachake. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Zvino vadosvika papfupi nomusha wavanga vachienda, Iye adoita kunge waakupindirira. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ivo vadomurambidza kuenda vachiti, “Gara naisisu, ndava nguwa yaenda, zuva radoka.” Saka adodzopinda kogara navo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Zvino adodzogarikika navo kuti vaje, adotora mazingwa, ndokuropafadza, ndokukomora achibva wavapasa. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Meso yavo yadopengenuka, ndokubva vamuziva, iye adobva wanyangarika. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Vadonyairirana vachiti, “Sei mwoyo yedu isinai kutirimuka paanga achinyaira naisisu munzira, panguwa yaanga achitivhurira magwaro?” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Vadosumuka paawa yakareyo vachidzokera kuJerusarema, vadowana vano gumi nomubodzi vadoungana pabodzi novavanga vanavo, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />ivo vadoti, “Ishe wamuka pachokwadi, futi wazviratidza kuna Simoni!” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Ipopo vadorondedzera zvanga zvaitika munzira, nomaziviro yavadomuita pakukomora zingwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anozvionesa Kuvadzidzi Vache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mariko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Johwani 20:19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Pavanga vachitaura zvakarezvo, Jesu pachake adomira pakati pavo. <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Asi vadovhunduka vachicha, vachifunga kuti vanga vachiona chipoko. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Sei muri kunetseka, futi sei munomibvunzo iri kumuka mumwoyo menyu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Onai manja yangu notsoka dzangu, kuti ndini pachangu, ndibatei, muone, ndava chipoko hachinai nyama nomapfupa sezvamuri kuona kuti ndinazvo.” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Adobva wavanangidza manja notsoka dzache. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Vachiri kutadza kuzvitenda nomufaro, vachishamisika, adoti kwavari, “Muno chokuja chere pano?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Vadomupasa nhindi yohove idogochewa, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Adoitora ndokuija pamberi pavo. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ipopo adoti kwavari, “Aya ndiyo mazvi yangu yandidonyaira kwamuri, ndichiri nemi, kuti zvese zvidonyorewa pamusoro pangu mumutemo waMozisi novaporofiti nomapisarema zvinofanira kuzazisiwa.” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Ipopo adovhura pfungwa dzavo kuti vanzvitsitse Magwaro, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />futi adoti kwavari, “Ndizvo zvidonyohwa kuti Khirisitu anofanira kutambudzika nozuva rochitatu womuka kubva kuvadopfa, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />kuti kupinduka nokuregerehwa kwozvitadzo kuparidziwe muzita rache kumarudzi yese, kuthanga muJerusarema. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Imimi muri zvapupu zvozvinhu zvakarezvi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Onai, ndinotumira chipikihwa chaBaba vangu pamusoro penyu, asi garai muguta kusvikira masimidziwa nosimba rinobva kumusoro.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anokwira Kudenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mariko 16:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ipopo adovatungamira kunze papfupi noBhetani, adosumudza maoko yache ndokuvaropafadza. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Paanga achivaropafadza, adopararana navo, ndokutohwa kuenda kudenga. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ivo vadodzokera kuJerusarema nomufaro mukuru, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />vadoramba vari muimba yaMwari vachikudza Mwari.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>